  42:       un ticket qui s'imprime ligne par ligne, coche ou croix a gauche, valeur a droite
  43:   {"type": "appel", "etapes": [{"icone": "telephone", "label": "Appel de votre CPAM", "note": "en principe"},
  44:                                {"icone": "courrier", "label": "Puis le courrier"}]}
  45:       un telephone qui sonne, une fleche, puis le courrier qui arrive en vol
  46:   {"type": "loupe", "site": "ameli.fr", "recherche": "mise sous objectifs", "vide": "Aucun résultat"}
  47:       la recherche se tape, la loupe balaie la page, rien ne sort
  48:   {"type": "calcul", "titre": "...", "temps_question": 1,
  49:    "parts": [{"label": "...", "valeur": 0.68}, {"label": "...", "valeur": 0.32, "question": true}]}
  50:       une barre qui se remplit ; la part "question" se detache, un « ? » au-dessus. Les parts
  51:       sont une illustration : aucun chiffre ne s'affiche. "ton": "rouge", "vert" ou "bleu"
  52:       colore une part et son libelle (trois regimes selon l'age, par exemple)
  53: 
  54:   {"type": "ages", "titre": "...", "ordre": [2, 1, 0], "zones": [{"label": "Avant l'âge légal",
  55:                                                                 "bulle": "Réduite dès le 1er €", "ton": "rouge"}, ...]}
  56:       une regle en zones colorees ; un curseur va de zone en zone, une bulle dit ce qui s'y passe
  57:   {"type": "vases", "titre": "1 € gagné, 1 € de pension en moins", "gauche": "...", "droite": "...",
  58:    "ajout": {"label": "IJ", "temps": 1}}
  59:       deux bocaux communicants : l'un monte, l'autre baisse d'autant ; une piece tombe ensuite
  60:   {"type": "pieces", "titre": "Au-delà du seuil", "gauche": "...", "droite": "...", "temps": 1}
  61:       deux piles de pieces : deux s'empilent a gauche, une s'envole a droite, compteurs
  62:   {"type": "part", "pastille": "...", "part": 20, "centre": "au plus", "legende_part": "...",
  63:    "legende_reste": "...", "temps_part": 1}
  64:       un anneau d'activite qui se remplit, la part plafonnee se detache, son pourcentage au centre
  65:   {"type": "bascule", "avant": {"haut": "Sept. 2026", "jour": "30", "bas": "..."}, "apres": {...},
  66:    "legende_avant": "...", "legende_apres": "...", "pilule": "Nouvelles règles", "temps": 1}
  67:       un ephemeride dont la page se plie pour montrer la suivante ; une pilule claque
  68:   {"type": "icones", "cartes": [{"icone": "repere" | "lune" | "casque" | "poubelle" | "bon" | "enfant",
  69:                                  "label": "...", "temps": 1}, ...]}
  70:       des cartes a icone dessinee, un « ? » qui se balance au coin de chacune
  71:   {"type": "prix", "boites": [{"nom": "Vaxigrip", "prix": "11,75 €"}, {..., "ton": "rouge"}],
  72:    "pastille": "plus du double"}
  73:       des boites de vaccin dessinees, une etiquette de prix tombe sur chacune, une pastille claque
  74: 
  75: Reels docteurs juniors et acces direct aux IPA (28/10/2026) :
  76: 
  77:   {"type": "carte", "titulaire": "Docteur junior", "ok": true, "temps": 1}
  78:       une carte CPS au nom du titulaire glisse dans le lecteur ; l'ecran repond coche ou croix
  79:       (refusee, la carte tremble)
  80:   {"type": "compteur", "titre": "Cartes CPS délivrées", "date": "au 28 octobre", "pilule": "...", "temps": 1}
  81:       des rouleaux de chiffres qui defilent puis s'arretent sur « ? » ; aucun nombre ne reste
  82:   {"type": "bouclier", "temps": 1, "pilules": [{"texte": "...", "ton": "rouge", "temps": 1}, ...]}
  83:       un bouclier sur une silhouette, dont le contour passe en pointilles avec un « ? » ; les
  84:       pilules du texte a droite
  85:   {"type": "departements", "liste": [{"numero": "34", "nom": "Hérault"}, ...]}
  86:       des tuiles de departement qui se retournent l'une apres l'autre
  87:   {"type": "ordonnance", "titre": "Ordonnance", "marque": "IPA", "lignes": [{"label": "...", "note": "...",
  88:    "temps": 1}], "pied": "...", "temps_pied": 2}
  89:       une ordonnance qui s'ecrit au stylo, ligne par ligne, une pilule rouge au pied
  90:   {"type": "sablier", "pilules": [...]}
  91:       un sablier qui coule et se retourne sans fin, un « ? » ; les pilules du texte a droite
  92:   {"type": "pilule", "texte": "Aucune rémunération prévue", "temps": 1}
  93:       une pilule seule qui claque, sous un dessin : elle ne cache pas ses libelles
  94:   "appel" accepte aussi l'icone "infirmier", et un "temps" par etape ; "icones" accepte les icones
  95:   "compte_rendu", "concertation", "patient", et par carte "question": false (une tache, pas une
  96:   question ouverte) ou "temps_question"
  97: 
  98: Le champ "insert" peut aussi etre une liste : les elements s'empilent dans l'ordre, et
  99: "sur": true centre un element sur le premier (un tampon qui claque sur un dessin).
 100: 
 101: Un element (ligne, barre, tampon) peut porter "temps" : il arrive avec le temps du texte
 102: de ce numero (0 = debut du bloc, 1 = apres le premier "|"...). "carre": false dans l'insert
 103: le retire de la version carree, quand il n'y tient pas (bloc 1, sous la pastille d'ouverture). L'insert se cale en bas sur
 104: le haut du texte (et de la pastille d'ouverture), en haut sur INSERT_HAUT_MIN, a gauche sur
 105: la colonne de texte ; il retrecit s'il le faut. Il sort avec le texte du bloc.
 106: Toutes les valeurs viennent de config/charte.py — ne rien coder en dur ici.
 107: """
 108: import calendar
 109: import math
 110: import sys
 111: from pathlib import Path
 112: 
 113: from PIL import Image, ImageChops, ImageDraw
 114: 
 115: sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent))
 116: from config import charte as C
 117: from lcdg import habillage as hb
 118: from lcdg import texte as T
 119: 
 120: MOIS = ["janvier", "février", "mars", "avril", "mai", "juin", "juillet", "août", "septembre",
 121:         "octobre", "novembre", "décembre"]
 122: JOURS = "LMMJVSD"
 123: NBSP = " "
 124: 
 125: 
 126: def _ecrire(d, xy, texte, px, graisse, couleur, ancre="la"):
 127:     d.text(xy, T.normaliser(texte), font=T._police(px, graisse), fill=couleur, anchor=ancre)
 128: 
 129: 
 130: def _ombre(im, s):
 131:     flou, alpha, dy = C.INSERT_OMBRE
 132:     return hb.shadow(im, blur=max(2, int(flou * s)), alpha=alpha, offset=(0, max(1, int(dy * s))))
 133: 
 134: 
 135: def _cadre(w, h, s, couleur=C.BLANC, marge=0):
 136:     """Carte arrondie (avec une marge transparente pour l'ombre)."""
 137:     im = Image.new("RGBA", (w + 2 * marge, h + 2 * marge), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 138:     ImageDraw.Draw(im).rounded_rectangle([marge, marge, marge + w - 1, marge + h - 1],
 139:                                          radius=max(4, int(C.INSERT_RAYON * s)),
 140:                                          fill=tuple(couleur) + (255,))
 141:     return im
 142: 
 143: 
 144: def _poser(fond, im, cx, cy, k=1.0, alpha=1.0, angle=0.0):
 145:     """Colle im centre en (cx, cy), a l'echelle k, tourne de angle degres."""
 146:     if alpha <= 0.003 or k <= 0.01:
 147:         return
 148:     if abs(k - 1) > 0.01:
 149:         im = im.resize((max(1, int(im.width * k)), max(1, int(im.height * k))), Image.BICUBIC)
 150:     if abs(angle) > 0.05:
 151:         im = im.rotate(angle, resample=Image.BICUBIC, expand=True)
 152:     T.coller(fond, im, (cx - im.width / 2, cy - im.height / 2), min(1.0, alpha))
 153: 
 154: 
 155: def _nombre(v, dec):
 156:     # meme ecriture que les chiffres cles (habillage.Chiffre.nombre) : milliers separes par
 157:     # une espace fine, virgule decimale (« 3 400 », « 49,6 »)
 158:     return f"{v:,.{dec}f}".replace(",", " ").replace(".", ",")
 159: 
 160: 
 161: class _Insert:
 162:     """Placement, entree commune et sortie avec le texte du bloc."""
 163: 
 164:     def __init__(self, nom, spec, scene, bas):
 165:         self.nom, self.spec, self.scene = nom, spec, scene
 166:         self.debut, self.fin = scene.debut, scene.fin
 167:         self.instants = [scene.debut] + [p.debut for p in scene.parts[1:]]
 168:         w0, h0 = self.taille_nominale()
 169:         dispo = bas - C.INSERT_HAUT_MIN
 170:         self.s = min(1.0, dispo / h0, C.TEXTE_LARGEUR / w0)
 171:         if self.s < C.INSERT_ECHELLE_MIN:
 172:             raise SystemExit(f"[!] {nom} : pas la place pour l'insert « {spec['type']} » au-dessus "
 173:                              f"du texte ({dispo:.0f} px pour {h0} px). Raccourcis le texte du bloc "
 174:                              "ou retire l'insert.")
 175:         self.w, self.h = int(w0 * self.s), int(h0 * self.s)
 176:         self.m = int(C.INSERT_OMBRE[0] * C.INSERT_MARGE_OMBRE * self.s) + 4   # ombres
 177:         self.x, self.y = C.TEXTE_X, bas - self.h
 178:         self.rubrique = tuple(hb._RUBRIQUE)
 179: 
 180:     def px(self, v):
 181:         return max(1, int(round(v * self.s)))
 182: 
 183:     def t0(self, k=0):
 184:         return self.instants[min(max(0, k), len(self.instants) - 1)] + C.INSERT_DELAI
 185: 
 186:     def taille_nominale(self):
 187:         raise NotImplementedError
 188: 
 189:     def image(self, t, final):
 190:         raise NotImplementedError
 191: 
 192:     def sons(self):
 193:         return []
 194: 
 195:     def dessiner(self, lay, t, final=False):
 196:         so = 0.0 if final else self.scene.parts[-1]._sortie(t)
 197:         if so >= 1:
 198:             return
 199:         im = self.image(t, final)
 200:         if im is not None:
 201:             T.coller(lay, im, (self.x - self.m, self.y - self.m - C.SORTIE_MONTEE * so), 1 - so)
 202: 
 203:     def couche(self):
 204:         lay = hb._vide(); self.dessiner(lay, 0, final=True)
 205:         return lay
 206: 
 207: 
 208: # ----------------------------------------------------------------- verrou
 209: class Verrou(_Insert):
 210:     """Les recommandations gardees pour le site : une carte fermee par recommandation."""
 211: 
 212:     def taille_nominale(self):
 213:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.VERROU_CARTE_H
 214: 
 215:     def __init__(self, *a):
 216:         super().__init__(*a)
 217:         self.n = int(self.spec["n"])
 218:         g = self.px(C.INSERT_ECART_ELEMENTS)
 219:         self.cw = (self.w - (self.n - 1) * g) // self.n
 220:         self.pas = self.cw + g
 221:         self.cartes = [self._carte(i + 1) for i in range(self.n)]
 222:         self.cadenas = self._cadenas()
 223: 
 224:     def _carte(self, numero):
 225:         cw, ch, s, m = self.cw, self.h, self.s, self.m
 226:         im = _cadre(cw, ch, s, marge=m)
 227:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 228:         g = C.VERROU_GEO
 229:         r = self.px(g["rond"])
 230:         cx, cy = m + self.px(g["rond_marge"]) + r, m + self.px(g["rond_marge"]) + r
 231:         d.ellipse([cx - r, cy - r, cx + r, cy + r], fill=self.rubrique + (255,))
 232:         _ecrire(d, (cx, cy), str(numero), self.px(g["numero_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
 233:                 C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 234:         pad = self.px(g["pad"])
 235:         for k, frac in enumerate(C.VERROU_LIGNES):
 236:             y = m + self.px(g["ligne_y"]) + k * self.px(g["ligne_pas"])
 237:             d.rounded_rectangle([m + pad, y, m + pad + int((cw - 2 * pad) * frac), y + self.px(g["ligne_h"])],
 238:                                 radius=self.px(g["ligne_h"] / 2), fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,))
 239:         return _ombre(im, s)
 240: 
 241:     def _cadenas(self):
 242:         s = self.s
 243:         g = C.VERROU_GEO
 244:         r = self.px(g["pastille"])                       # pastille blanche sous le cadenas
 245:         im = Image.new("RGBA", (2 * r + 8, 2 * r + 8), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 246:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 247:         c = r + 4
 248:         d.ellipse([c - r, c - r, c + r, c + r], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
 249:         bw, bh = self.px(g["corps"][0]), self.px(g["corps"][1])
 250:         x0, y0 = c - bw / 2, c - bh / 2 + self.px(g["corps_bas"])
 251:         anse, trait = self.px(g["anse"]), self.px(g["trait"])
 252:         haut_anse = y0 - anse * 0.15                     # centre de l'arc de l'anse
 253:         d.arc([c - anse / 2, haut_anse - anse * 0.7, c + anse / 2, haut_anse + anse * 0.7],
 254:               180, 360, fill=C.NAVY + (255,), width=trait)
 255:         for xa in (c - anse / 2 + trait / 2, c + anse / 2 - trait / 2):   # les branches
 256:             d.line([(xa, haut_anse), (xa, y0 + 2)], fill=C.NAVY + (255,), width=trait)
 257:         d.rounded_rectangle([x0, y0, x0 + bw, y0 + bh], radius=self.px(g["corps_rayon"]),
 258:                             fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
 259:         k = self.px(g["trou"])
 260:         d.ellipse([c - k, y0 + bh * 0.36 - k, c + k, y0 + bh * 0.36 + k], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
 261:         d.rectangle([c - k / 3, y0 + bh * 0.36, c + k / 3, y0 + bh * 0.72], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
 262:         return _ombre(im, s)
 263: 
 264:     def _t(self, i):
 265:         return self.t0() + i * C.INSERT_DECALAGE
 266: 
 267:     def image(self, t, final):
 268:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 269:         for i, carte in enumerate(self.cartes):
 270:             u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 271:             if u <= 0:
 272:                 continue
 273:             k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
 274:             dy = 0 if final else C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(u))
 275:             cx = self.m + i * self.pas + self.cw / 2
 276:             cy = self.m + self.h / 2 + dy
 277:             _poser(out, carte, cx, cy, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 278:             # le cadenas tremble une fois, quand la carte est posee
 279:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i) - C.VERROU_SECOUSSE[1]) / C.VERROU_SECOUSSE[2]
 280:             angle = 0.0 if (final or not 0 < v < 1) else \
 281:                 C.VERROU_SECOUSSE[0] * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 3 * v) * (1 - v)
 282:             _poser(out, self.cadenas, cx, cy + self.h * C.VERROU_GEO["cadenas_y"] * k, k,
 283:                    1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU), angle)
 284:         return out
 285: 
 286:     def sons(self):
 287:         return [(self._t(i), "clic") for i in range(self.n)]
 288: 
 289: 
 290: # ------------------------------------------------------------- calendrier
 291: class Calendrier(_Insert):
 292:     """Le mois en carte, la periode qui compte surlignee, une etiquette a cote."""
 293: 
 294:     def taille_nominale(self):
 295:         lg = T.largeur(T.normaliser(self.spec.get("legende", "")), C.CAL_ETIQUETTE_PX,
 296:                        C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0)
 297:         self.etiquette_w0 = int(lg + 2 * C.CAL_ETIQUETTE_PAD) if self.spec.get("legende") else 0
 298:         w = C.CAL_W + (C.INSERT_ECART_ELEMENTS + self.etiquette_w0 if self.etiquette_w0 else 0)
 299:         return w, C.CAL_H
 300: 
 301:     def __init__(self, *a):
 302:         super().__init__(*a)
 303:         sp = self.spec
 304:         self.cw = self.px(C.CAL_W)
 305:         semaines = calendar.Calendar(0).monthdayscalendar(sp["annee"], sp["mois"])
 306:         g = C.CAL_GEO
 307:         pad, tete = self.px(g["pad"]), self.px(C.CAL_TETE)
 308:         jours_y = tete + self.px(g["jours_y"])
 309:         grille_y = jours_y + self.px(g["grille_y"])
 310:         cel_w = (self.cw - 2 * pad) / 7
 311:         cel_h = (self.h - grille_y - pad) / len(semaines)
 312:         self.cellules = {}
 313:         for li, sem in enumerate(semaines):
 314:             for co, jour in enumerate(sem):
 315:                 if jour:
 316:                     self.cellules[jour] = (pad + co * cel_w, grille_y + li * cel_h, cel_w, cel_h)
 317:         m = self.m
 318:         fond = _cadre(self.cw, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
 319:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(fond)
 320:         d.rounded_rectangle([m, m, m + self.cw - 1, m + tete], radius=max(4, int(C.INSERT_RAYON * self.s)),
 321:                             fill=self.rubrique + (255,))
 322:         d.rectangle([m, m + tete // 2, m + self.cw - 1, m + tete], fill=self.rubrique + (255,))
 323:         titre = f"{MOIS[sp['mois'] - 1]} {sp['annee']}".upper()
 324:         _ecrire(d, (m + self.cw / 2, m + tete / 2), titre, self.px(g["titre_px"]),
 325:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 326:         for co, j in enumerate(JOURS):
 327:             _ecrire(d, (m + pad + (co + 0.5) * cel_w, m + jours_y), j, self.px(g["jour_px"]),
 328:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
 329:         self.chiffres_blancs = Image.new("RGBA", fond.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
 330:         db = ImageDraw.Draw(self.chiffres_blancs)
 331:         for jour, (x, y, w, h) in self.cellules.items():
 332:             xy = (m + x + w / 2, m + y + h / 2)
 333:             _ecrire(d, xy, str(jour), self.px(g["numero_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_CHIFFRE,
 334:                     C.NAVY + (255,), "mm")
 335:             if sp["du"] <= jour <= sp["au"]:
 336:                 _ecrire(db, xy, str(jour), self.px(g["numero_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
 337:                         C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 338:         self.fond = _ombre(fond, self.s)
 339:         x0, y0, _, h0 = self.cellules[sp["du"]]
 340:         x1, _, w1, _ = self.cellules[sp["au"]]
 341:         r = self.px(g["bande_retrait"])
 342:         self.bande = (m + x0 + r, m + y0 + r, m + x1 + w1 - r, m + y0 + h0 - r)
 343:         self.etiquette = None
 344:         if self.etiquette_w0:
 345:             ew, eh = self.px(self.etiquette_w0), self.px(C.CAL_ETIQUETTE_H)
 346:             et = Image.new("RGBA", (ew, eh), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 347:             de = ImageDraw.Draw(et)
 348:             de.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, ew - 1, eh - 1], radius=eh // 2, fill=self.rubrique + (255,))
 349:             _ecrire(de, (ew / 2, eh / 2), sp["legende"], self.px(C.CAL_ETIQUETTE_PX),
 350:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 351:             self.etiquette = _ombre(et, self.s)
 352:             self.etiquette_c = (m + self.cw + self.px(C.INSERT_ECART_ELEMENTS) + ew / 2,
 353:                                 (self.bande[1] + self.bande[3]) / 2)
 354: 
 355:     def _temps(self):
 356:         t0 = self.t0()
 357:         balai = t0 + C.CAL_BALAYAGE_DELAI
 358:         return t0, balai, balai + C.INSERT_POUSSE
 359: 
 360:     def image(self, t, final):
 361:         t0, balai, fin_balai = self._temps()
 362:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - t0) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 363:         if u <= 0:
 364:             return None
 365:         carte = self.fond.copy()
 366:         p = 1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - balai) / C.INSERT_POUSSE)
 367:         if p > 0:
 368:             x0, y0, x1, y1 = self.bande
 369:             xe = x0 + (x1 - x0) * p
 370:             ImageDraw.Draw(carte).rounded_rectangle([x0, y0, xe, y1],
 371:                                                     radius=self.px(C.CAL_GEO["bande_rayon"]),
 372:                                                     fill=self.rubrique + (255,))
 373:             masque = Image.new("L", carte.size, 0)
 374:             ImageDraw.Draw(masque).rectangle([x0, y0, xe, y1], fill=255)
 375:             # les jours de la periode passent en blanc, au rythme du balayage
 376:             blancs = self.chiffres_blancs.copy()
 377:             blancs.putalpha(Image.composite(blancs.getchannel("A"), masque, masque))
 378:             carte.alpha_composite(blancs)
 379:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 380:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
 381:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k,
 382:                1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 383:         if self.etiquette is not None:
 384:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - fin_balai) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 385:             if v > 0:
 386:                 ke = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
 387:                 _poser(out, self.etiquette, *self.etiquette_c, ke,
 388:                        1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 389:         return out
 390: 
 391:     def sons(self):
 392:         t0, balai, fin_balai = self._temps()
 393:         out = [(t0, "souffle"), (balai, "clic")]
 394:         if self.etiquette is not None:
 395:             out.append((fin_balai, "clic"))
 396:         return out
 397: 
 398: 
 399: # ----------------------------------------------------------------- barres
 400: class Barres(_Insert):
 401:     """Des barres horizontales qui poussent, la valeur qui defile au bout."""
 402: 
 403:     def taille_nominale(self):
 404:         n = len(self.spec["lignes"])
 405:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, 2 * C.BARRES_PAD + n * C.BARRES_LIGNE_H
 406: 
 407:     def __init__(self, *a):
 408:         super().__init__(*a)
 409:         sp = self.spec
 410:         self.unite = T.normaliser(sp.get("unite", ""))
 411:         # suffixe colle au nombre par une espace insecable : « 50 € »
 412:         self.suffixe = T.normaliser(sp.get("suffixe", "")).replace(" ", "\u00a0")
 413:         self.lignes = sp["lignes"]
 414:         self.vmax = max(l["valeur"] for l in self.lignes)
 415:         self.dec = max((len(str(l["valeur"]).split(".")[1]) if "." in str(l["valeur"]) else 0)
 416:                        for l in self.lignes)
 417:         self.depart = 1.0 if self.unite in ("×", "x") else 0.0
 418:         pad = self.px(C.BARRES_PAD)
 419:         val_w = T.largeur(f"{self.unite}{_nombre(self.vmax, self.dec)}{self.suffixe}",
 420:                           self.px(C.BARRES_VALEUR_PX), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0)
 421:         self.barre_max = self.w - 2 * pad - val_w - self.px(C.BARRES_GEO["valeur_marge"])
 422:         self.pad = pad
 423:         self._fonds = {}
 424: 
 425:     def _fond(self, hc):
 426:         """Carte de hauteur hc (elle grandit a chaque nouvelle barre), gardee en cache."""
 427:         if hc not in self._fonds:
 428:             self._fonds[hc] = _ombre(_cadre(self.w, hc, self.s, marge=self.m), self.s)
 429:         return self._fonds[hc]
 430: 
 431:     def _hauteur(self, t, final):
 432:         lh = self.px(C.BARRES_LIGNE_H)
 433:         if final:
 434:             return self.h
 435:         n = sum(T.lisse((t - self._t(i)) / C.BARRES_OUVERTURE) for i in range(len(self.lignes)))
 436:         return min(self.h, int(2 * self.pad + n * lh))
 437: 
 438:     def _t(self, i):
 439:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.lignes[j].get("temps", 0) == self.lignes[i].get("temps", 0)]
 440:         return self.t0(self.lignes[i].get("temps", 0)) + C.BARRES_DELAI + len(precedentes) * C.BARRES_DECALAGE
 441: 
 442:     def image(self, t, final):
 443:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 444:         if u <= 0:
 445:             return None
 446:         # la carte est calee en bas, sur le texte : elle grandit vers le haut, et les barres
 447:         # deja posees montent avec elle
 448:         hc = self._hauteur(t, final)
 449:         carte = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 450:         haut = self.h - hc
 451:         carte.alpha_composite(self._fond(hc), (0, haut))
 452:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
 453:         m, pad = self.m, self.pad
 454:         for i, l in enumerate(self.lignes):
 455:             v_ = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_POUSSE
 456:             if v_ <= 0:
 457:                 continue
 458:             p = 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v_)
 459:             y = m + haut + pad + i * self.px(C.BARRES_LIGNE_H)
 460:             if y + self.px(C.BARRES_LIGNE_H) > m + haut + hc + self.px(C.BARRES_GEO["tolerance"]):
 461:                 continue                                 # pas encore de place pour cette ligne
 462:             a = int(255 * min(1.0, 1.0 if final else v_ * C.BARRES_GEO["fondu_ligne"]))
 463:             _ecrire(d, (m + pad, y), l["label"], self.px(C.BARRES_LABEL_PX), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE,
 464:                     C.NAVY + (a,))
 465:             yb = y + self.px(C.BARRES_LABEL_PX + C.BARRES_GEO["label_ecart"])
 466:             hb_ = self.px(C.BARRES_EPAISSEUR)
 467:             # une premiere ligne a x1 (multiplicateur) est la reference : grise
 468:             reference = l.get("reference", i == 0 and self.depart == 1.0 and l["valeur"] == 1)
 469:             couleur = C.INSERT_GRIS if reference else self.rubrique
 470:             longueur = max(hb_, self.barre_max * l["valeur"] / self.vmax * p)
 471:             d.rounded_rectangle([m + pad, yb, m + pad + longueur, yb + hb_], radius=hb_ // 2,
 472:                                 fill=tuple(couleur) + (a,))
 473:             v = self.depart + (l["valeur"] - self.depart) * p
 474:             # des que l'arrondi atteint la cible, la valeur s'affiche telle quelle (« ×2 »,
 475:             # pas « ×2,0 » quelques images avant)
 476:             if p >= 1 or round(v, self.dec) == round(l["valeur"], self.dec):
 477:                 v, dec = l["valeur"], (0 if float(l["valeur"]).is_integer() else self.dec)
 478:             else:
 479:                 dec = self.dec
 480:             texte = f"{self.unite}{_nombre(v, dec)}{self.suffixe}"
 481:             _ecrire(d, (m + pad + longueur + self.px(C.BARRES_GEO["valeur_ecart"]), yb + hb_ / 2),
 482:                     texte, self.px(C.BARRES_VALEUR_PX), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
 483:                     (C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE if reference else C.NAVY) + (a,), "lm")
 484:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 485:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
 486:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k,
 487:                1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 488:         return out
 489: 
 490:     def sons(self):
 491:         return [(self._t(i), "clic") for i in range(len(self.lignes))]
 492: 
 493: 
 494: # ------------------------------------------------------------------ choix
 495: class Choix(_Insert):
 496:     """Une liste ou chaque ligne recoit une coche verte ou une croix rouge."""
 497: 
 498:     def taille_nominale(self):
 499:         n = len(self.spec["lignes"])
 500:         larg = max(T.largeur(T.normaliser(l["label"]), C.CHOIX_PX, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, 0)
 501:                    for l in self.spec["lignes"])
 502:         w = int(C.CHOIX_PAD * 3 + C.CHOIX_ICONE + larg + C.CHOIX_PAD)
 503:         return max(w, C.CHOIX_LARGEUR_MIN), n * C.CHOIX_LIGNE_H + (n - 1) * C.CHOIX_ECART
 504: 
 505:     def __init__(self, *a):
 506:         super().__init__(*a)
 507:         self.lignes = self.spec["lignes"]
 508:         self.lh = self.px(C.CHOIX_LIGNE_H)
 509:         self.pas = self.lh + self.px(C.CHOIX_ECART)
 510:         self.cartes = [self._ligne(l) for l in self.lignes]
 511:         self.icones = [self._icone(l.get("ok")) for l in self.lignes]
 512: 
 513:     def _ligne(self, l):
 514:         m = self.m
 515:         im = _cadre(self.w, self.lh, self.s, marge=m)
 516:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 517:         x = m + self.px(C.CHOIX_PAD) * 2 + self.px(C.CHOIX_ICONE)
 518:         _ecrire(d, (x, m + self.lh / 2), l["label"], self.px(C.CHOIX_PX), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE,
 519:                 C.NAVY + (255,), "lm")
 520:         return _ombre(im, self.s)
 521: 
 522:     def _icone(self, ok):
 523:         return _icone_choix(ok, self.px(C.CHOIX_ICONE), self.px(C.CHOIX_GEO["trait"]), self.rubrique)
 524: 
 525:     def _t(self, i):
 526:         l = self.lignes[i]
 527:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.lignes[j].get("temps", 0) == l.get("temps", 0)]
 528:         return self.t0(l.get("temps", 0)) + len(precedentes) * C.CHOIX_DECALAGE
 529: 
 530:     def image(self, t, final):
 531:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 532:         for i, (carte, icone) in enumerate(zip(self.cartes, self.icones)):
 533:             u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 534:             if u <= 0:
 535:                 continue
 536:             dx = 0 if final else -C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(u))
 537:             cy = self.m + i * self.pas + self.lh / 2
 538:             _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2 + dx, cy, 1.0,
 539:                    1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 540:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i) - C.CHOIX_ICONE_DELAI) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 541:             if v > 0:
 542:                 k0 = C.CHOIX_GEO["icone_depart"]
 543:                 k = k0 + (1 - k0) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
 544:                 cx = self.m + self.px(C.CHOIX_PAD) + self.px(C.CHOIX_ICONE) / 2 + dx
 545:                 # une question ouverte ne tient pas en place : son « ? » se balance
 546:                 angle = 0.0
 547:                 if not final and self.lignes[i].get("ok") is None and v > 1:
 548:                     amp, freq = C.CHOIX_GEO["balance"]
 549:                     angle = amp * math.sin(2 * math.pi * freq * (t - self._t(i)))
 550:                 _poser(out, icone, cx, cy, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.CHOIX_GEO["fondu_icone"]), angle)
 551:         return out
 552: 
 553:     def sons(self):
 554:         return [(self._t(i) + C.CHOIX_ICONE_DELAI, "clic") for i in range(len(self.lignes))]
 555: 
 556: 
 557: # ----------------------------------------------------------------- tampon
 558: class Tampon(_Insert):
 559:     """Un tampon qui claque sur l'image (« Export interdit »)."""
 560: 
 561:     def _sprite(self, s):
 562:         texte = T.normaliser(self.spec["texte"]).upper()
 563:         px = max(8, int(C.TAMPON_PX * s))
 564:         f = T._police(px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE)
 565:         b = f.getbbox(texte)
 566:         tw, th = b[2] - b[0], b[3] - b[1]
 567:         g = C.TAMPON_GEO
 568:         padx, pady = int(C.TAMPON_PAD[0] * s), int(C.TAMPON_PAD[1] * s)
 569:         trait = max(2, int(g["trait"] * s))
 570:         w, h = tw + 2 * padx, th + 2 * pady
 571:         im = Image.new("RGBA", (w + 8, h + 8), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 572:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 573:         rouge = C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255,)
 574:         d.rounded_rectangle([4, 4, 4 + w, 4 + h], radius=max(4, int(g["rayon"] * s)),
 575:                             fill=C.BLANC + (C.TAMPON_FOND,), outline=rouge, width=trait)
 576:         i = trait + max(2, int(g["filet_retrait"] * s))
 577:         d.rounded_rectangle([4 + i, 4 + i, 4 + w - i, 4 + h - i], radius=max(3, int(g["filet_rayon"] * s)),
 578:                             outline=rouge, width=max(1, trait // 3))
 579:         d.text((4 + padx - b[0], 4 + pady - b[1]), texte, font=f, fill=rouge)
 580:         return im.rotate(C.TAMPON_ANGLE, resample=Image.BICUBIC, expand=True)
 581: 
 582:     def taille_nominale(self):
 583:         im = self._sprite(1.0)
 584:         return im.width, im.height
 585: 
 586:     def __init__(self, *a):
 587:         super().__init__(*a)
 588:         self.sprite = _ombre(self._sprite(self.s), self.s)
 589: 
 590:     def _t(self):
 591:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0))
 592: 
 593:     def dessiner(self, lay, t, final=False):
 594:         """Colle le tampon directement sur le cadre : agrandi au moment de la frappe, il
 595:         deborde de sa boite."""
 596:         so = 0.0 if final else self.scene.parts[-1]._sortie(t)
 597:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t()) / C.TAMPON_FRAPPE
 598:         if so >= 1 or u <= 0:
 599:             return
 600:         k = 1.0 if final or u >= 1 else C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - (C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - 1) * u * u
 601:         dx = 0.0
 602:         if not final and u > 1:
 603:             v = (t - self._t() - C.TAMPON_FRAPPE) / C.TAMPON_SECOUSSE[1]
 604:             if v < 1:
 605:                 dx = C.TAMPON_SECOUSSE[0] * self.s * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 4 * v) * (1 - v)
 606:         alpha = (1.0 if final else min(1.0, u * C.TAMPON_GEO["fondu"])) * (1 - so)
 607:         _poser(lay, self.sprite, self.x + self.w / 2 + dx,
 608:                self.y + self.h / 2 - C.SORTIE_MONTEE * so, k, alpha)
 609: 
 610:     def sons(self):
 611:         return [(self._t() + C.TAMPON_FRAPPE, "impact")]
 612: 
 613: 
 614: def _couper(texte, px, graisse, largeur):
 615:     """Decoupe un libelle en lignes qui tiennent dans largeur (mots entiers)."""
 616:     lignes, cur = [], ""
 617:     for mot in T.normaliser(texte).split(" "):
 618:         essai = f"{cur} {mot}".strip()
 619:         if cur and T.largeur(essai, px, graisse, 0) > largeur:
 620:             lignes.append(cur)
 621:             cur = mot
 622:         else:
 623:             cur = essai
 624:     return lignes + ([cur] if cur else [])
 625: 
 626: 
 627: def _pilule(texte, px, h, pad, fond, couleur):
 628:     w = int(T.largeur(T.normaliser(texte), px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0) + 2 * pad)
 629:     im = Image.new("RGBA", (w, h), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 630:     d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 631:     d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, w - 1, h - 1], radius=h // 2, fill=tuple(fond) + (255,))
 632:     _ecrire(d, (w / 2, h / 2), texte, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, tuple(couleur) + (255,), "mm")
 633:     return im
 634: 
 635: 
 636: def _fleche(d, x0, x1, y, p, trait, tete, couleur):
 637:     """Fleche horizontale de x0 a x1, tracee sur la fraction p (la pointe suit le trait)."""
 638:     if p <= 0:
 639:         return
 640:     xe = x0 + (x1 - x0) * min(1.0, p)
 641:     d.line([(x0, y), (max(x0, xe - tete * 0.6), y)], fill=couleur, width=trait)
 642:     d.polygon([(xe, y), (xe - tete, y - tete * 0.7), (xe - tete, y + tete * 0.7)], fill=couleur)
 643: 
 644: 
 645: # ---------------------------------------------------------------- circuit
 646: class Circuit(_Insert):
 647:     """Ce que devient l'argent, ligne par ligne : pilules reliees par des fleches, issue."""
 648: 
 649:     def _elements(self, l, s):
 650:         g = C.CIRCUIT_GEO
 651:         px, h, pad = max(8, int(C.CIRCUIT_PILULE_PX * s)), max(8, int(C.CIRCUIT_PILULE_H * s)), int(g["pilule_pad"] * s)
 652:         out = []
 653:         for e in l["etapes"]:
 654:             couleur = C.INSERT_ROUGE if e.startswith(("−", "-")) else C.INSERT_VERT if e.startswith("+") else C.NAVY
 655:             out.append(_pilule(e, px, h, pad, C.INSERT_GRIS, couleur))
 656:         if l.get("fin"):
 657:             fond = C.INSERT_VERT if l.get("ok") else C.INSERT_ROUGE
 658:             out.append(_pilule(l["fin"], max(8, int(C.CIRCUIT_FIN_PX * s)), h, pad, fond, C.BLANC))
 659:         return out
 660: 
 661:     def taille_nominale(self):
 662:         lignes = self.spec["lignes"]
 663:         larg = max(2 * C.CIRCUIT_PAD + sum(e.width for e in self._elements(l, 1.0))
 664:                    + (len(self._elements(l, 1.0)) - 1) * C.CIRCUIT_FLECHE for l in lignes)
 665:         n = len(lignes)
 666:         return max(C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, larg), n * C.CIRCUIT_LIGNE_H + (n - 1) * C.CIRCUIT_ECART
 667: 
 668:     def __init__(self, *a):
 669:         super().__init__(*a)
 670:         self.lignes = self.spec["lignes"]
 671:         self.lh = self.px(C.CIRCUIT_LIGNE_H)
 672:         self.pas = self.lh + self.px(C.CIRCUIT_ECART)
 673:         self.elements = [self._elements(l, self.s) for l in self.lignes]
 674:         self.cartes = []
 675:         for l in self.lignes:
 676:             im = _cadre(self.w, self.lh, self.s, marge=self.m)
 677:             _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(im), (self.m + self.px(C.CIRCUIT_PAD), self.m + self.px(C.CIRCUIT_GEO["titre_y"])),
 678:                     l.get("titre", ""), self.px(C.CIRCUIT_TITRE_PX), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE,
 679:                     C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,))
 680:             self.cartes.append(_ombre(im, self.s))
 681: 
 682:     def _t(self, i):
 683:         l = self.lignes[i]
 684:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.lignes[j].get("temps", 0) == l.get("temps", 0)]
 685:         return self.t0(l.get("temps", 0)) + len(precedentes) * C.INSERT_DECALAGE * 3
 686: 
 687:     def image(self, t, final):
 688:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 689:         g = C.CIRCUIT_GEO
 690:         trait, tete, marge = self.px(g["trait"]), self.px(g["tete"]), self.px(g["fleche_marge"])
 691:         for i, (carte, elements) in enumerate(zip(self.cartes, self.elements)):
 692:             u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 693:             if u <= 0:
 694:                 continue
 695:             dx = 0 if final else -C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(u))
 696:             top = self.m + i * self.pas
 697:             _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2 + dx, top + self.lh / 2, 1.0,
 698:                    1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 699:             cy = top + self.px(g["rangee_y"]) + (self.lh - self.px(g["rangee_y"])) / 2
 700:             x = self.m + self.px(C.CIRCUIT_PAD) + dx
 701:             d = ImageDraw.Draw(out)
 702:             for k, e in enumerate(elements):
 703:                 tk = self._t(i) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5 + k * C.CIRCUIT_DECALAGE
 704:                 v = 1.0 if final else (t - tk) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 705:                 if k > 0:                                # la fleche qui mene a cet element
 706:                     p = 1.0 if final else (t - (tk - C.CIRCUIT_DECALAGE * 0.75)) / (C.CIRCUIT_DECALAGE * 0.7)
 707:                     _fleche(d, x - self.px(C.CIRCUIT_FLECHE) + marge, x - marge, cy, p, trait, tete,
 708:                             C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,))
 709:                 if v > 0:
 710:                     kk = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
 711:                     _poser(out, e, x + e.width / 2, cy, kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 712:                 x += e.width + self.px(C.CIRCUIT_FLECHE)
 713:         return out
 714: 
 715:     def sons(self):
 716:         return [(self._t(i) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5 + k * C.CIRCUIT_DECALAGE, "clic")
 717:                 for i, el in enumerate(self.elements) for k in range(len(el))]
 718: 
 719: 
 720: # ------------------------------------------------------------------- duel
 721: class Duel(_Insert):
 722:     """Deux cartes datees face a face (une decision, puis son contraire), un « ≠ » entre."""
 723: 
 724:     def taille_nominale(self):
 725:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.DUEL_H
 726: 
 727:     def __init__(self, *a):
 728:         super().__init__(*a)
 729:         g = C.DUEL_GEO
 730:         self.cartes_spec = self.spec["cartes"][:2]
 731:         self.ecart = self.px(g["ecart"])
 732:         self.cw = (self.w - self.ecart) // 2
 733:         self.cartes = [self._carte(c) for c in self.cartes_spec]
 734:         r = self.px(C.DUEL_SIGNE) // 2
 735:         im = Image.new("RGBA", (2 * r + 8, 2 * r + 8), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 736:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 737:         d.ellipse([4, 4, 4 + 2 * r, 4 + 2 * r], fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
 738:         _ecrire(d, (4 + r, 4 + r), "≠", self.px(g["signe_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 739:         self.signe = _ombre(im, self.s)
 740: 
 741:     def _carte(self, c):
 742:         g, m = C.DUEL_GEO, self.m
 743:         im = _cadre(self.cw, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
 744:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 745:         tete = self.px(C.DUEL_TETE)
 746:         # "ok" absent : une option neutre, a la couleur de la rubrique
 747:         couleur = (self.rubrique if "ok" not in c else C.INSERT_VERT if c["ok"] else C.INSERT_ROUGE) + (255,)
 748:         rayon = max(4, int(C.INSERT_RAYON * self.s))
 749:         d.rounded_rectangle([m, m, m + self.cw - 1, m + tete], radius=rayon, fill=couleur)
 750:         d.rectangle([m, m + tete // 2, m + self.cw - 1, m + tete], fill=couleur)
 751:         _ecrire(d, (m + self.cw / 2, m + tete / 2), c["date"], self.px(C.DUEL_DATE_PX),
 752:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 753:         px = self.px(C.DUEL_TEXTE_PX)
 754:         lignes = _couper(c["texte"], px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, self.cw - 2 * self.px(g["pad"]))
 755:         lh = px * g["interligne"]
 756:         y0 = m + tete + (self.h - tete - lh * len(lignes)) / 2 + lh / 2
 757:         for k, ligne in enumerate(lignes):
 758:             _ecrire(d, (m + self.cw / 2, y0 + k * lh), ligne, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "mm")
 759:         return _ombre(im, self.s)
 760: 
 761:     def _t(self, i):
 762:         c = self.cartes_spec[i]
 763:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.cartes_spec[j].get("temps", 0) == c.get("temps", 0)]
 764:         return self.t0(c.get("temps", 0)) + len(precedentes) * C.DUEL_DECALAGE
 765: 
 766:     def _t_signe(self):
 767:         return max(self._t(i) for i in range(len(self.cartes))) + C.DUEL_SIGNE_DELAI
 768: 
 769:     def image(self, t, final):
 770:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 771:         for i, carte in enumerate(self.cartes):
 772:             u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 773:             if u <= 0:
 774:                 continue
 775:             sens = -1 if i == 0 else 1
 776:             dx = 0 if final else sens * C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(u))
 777:             k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
 778:             cx = self.m + i * (self.cw + self.ecart) + self.cw / 2 + dx
 779:             _poser(out, carte, cx, self.m + self.h / 2, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 780:         v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_signe()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 781:         if v > 0 and len(self.cartes) == 2:
 782:             k = 0.3 + 0.7 * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
 783:             angle = 0.0 if (final or v >= 1) else 12 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 2 * v) * (1 - v)
 784:             _poser(out, self.signe, self.m + self.w / 2, self.m + self.h / 2, k,
 785:                    1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU), angle)
 786:         return out
 787: 
 788:     def sons(self):
 789:         return [(self._t(i), "clic") for i in range(len(self.cartes))] + [(self._t_signe(), "impact")]
 790: 
 791: 
 792: # ------------------------------------------------------------------ frise
 793: class Frise(_Insert):
 794:     """Une procedure en etapes, de haut en bas : le trait descend de noeud en noeud, chaque
 795:     libelle se pose a droite de son noeud ; une etape "alerte" en rouge."""
 796: 
 797:     def _largeur_libelle(self, e, s):
 798:         graisse = C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE if e.get("alerte") else C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE
 799:         return T.largeur(T.normaliser(e["label"]), max(8, int(C.FRISE_LABEL_PX * s)), graisse, 0)
 800: 
 801:     def taille_nominale(self):
 802:         g = C.FRISE_GEO
 803:         n = len(self.spec["etapes"])
 804:         larg = 2 * C.FRISE_PAD + 2 * C.FRISE_NOEUD + g["label_x"] + max(
 805:             self._largeur_libelle(e, 1.0) for e in self.spec["etapes"])
 806:         return max(int(larg), C.CHOIX_LARGEUR_MIN), 2 * C.FRISE_PAD + n * C.FRISE_LIGNE_H
 807: 
 808:     def __init__(self, *a):
 809:         super().__init__(*a)
 810:         self.etapes = self.spec["etapes"]
 811:         self.pad = self.px(C.FRISE_PAD)
 812:         self.r = self.px(C.FRISE_NOEUD)
 813:         self.lh = self.px(C.FRISE_LIGNE_H)
 814:         self.xn = self.m + self.pad + self.r
 815:         self.ys = [self.m + self.pad + self.lh * (i + 0.5) for i in range(len(self.etapes))]
 816:         self.fond = _ombre(_cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=self.m), self.s)
 817:         self.noeuds = []
 818:         for i, e in enumerate(self.etapes):
 819:             couleur = (C.INSERT_ROUGE if e.get("alerte") else self.rubrique) + (255,)
 820:             im = Image.new("RGBA", (2 * self.r + 4, 2 * self.r + 4), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 821:             d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 822:             d.ellipse([2, 2, 2 + 2 * self.r, 2 + 2 * self.r], fill=couleur)
 823:             _ecrire(d, (2 + self.r, 2 + self.r), "!" if e.get("alerte") else str(i + 1),
 824:                     self.px(C.FRISE_GEO["numero_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 825:             self.noeuds.append(im)
 826: 
 827:     def _t(self, i):
 828:         e = self.etapes[i]
 829:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.etapes[j].get("temps", 0) == e.get("temps", 0)]
 830:         return self.t0(e.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.6 + len(precedentes) * C.FRISE_DECALAGE
 831: 
 832:     def image(self, t, final):
 833:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 834:         if u <= 0:
 835:             return None
 836:         carte = self.fond.copy()
 837:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
 838:         g = C.FRISE_GEO
 839:         trait = self.px(g["trait"])
 840:         d.line([(self.xn, self.ys[0]), (self.xn, self.ys[-1])], fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=trait)
 841:         for i in range(1, len(self.ys)):         # le trait colore descend jusqu'au noeud i
 842:             p = 1.0 if final else (t - (self._t(i) - C.FRISE_TRACE)) / C.FRISE_TRACE
 843:             if p > 0:
 844:                 y1 = self.ys[i - 1] + (self.ys[i] - self.ys[i - 1]) * min(1.0, p)
 845:                 couleur = (C.INSERT_ROUGE if self.etapes[i].get("alerte") else self.rubrique) + (255,)
 846:                 d.line([(self.xn, self.ys[i - 1]), (self.xn, y1)], fill=couleur, width=trait)
 847:         px = self.px(C.FRISE_LABEL_PX)
 848:         for i, e in enumerate(self.etapes):
 849:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
 850:             if v <= 0:
 851:                 continue
 852:             k = 0.3 + 0.7 * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
 853:             _poser(carte, self.noeuds[i], self.xn, self.ys[i], k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 854:             a = int(255 * (1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU)))
 855:             dx = 0 if final else -self.px(g["glisse"]) * (1 - T.lisse(v))
 856:             couleur = (C.INSERT_ROUGE if e.get("alerte") else C.NAVY) + (a,)
 857:             graisse = C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE if e.get("alerte") else C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE
 858:             _ecrire(d, (self.xn + self.r + self.px(g["label_x"]) + dx, self.ys[i]), e["label"], px, graisse,
 859:                     couleur, "lm")
 860:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 861:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
 862:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
 863:         return out
 864: 
 865:     def sons(self):
 866:         return [(self._t(i), "impact" if e.get("alerte") else "clic") for i, e in enumerate(self.etapes)]
 867: 
 868: 
 869: # ---------------------------------------------------- illustrations : outils
 870: def _net(w, h, dessiner):
 871:     """Forme sans escalier : tracee a INSERT_SURECHANTILLON fois sa taille, puis reduite.
 872:     dessiner(d, k) recoit le pinceau et le facteur k, a appliquer a toutes les longueurs."""
 873:     k = C.INSERT_SURECHANTILLON
 874:     w, h = max(1, int(round(w))), max(1, int(round(h)))
 875:     grand = Image.new("RGBA", (w * k, h * k), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 876:     dessiner(ImageDraw.Draw(grand), k)
 877:     return grand.resize((w, h), Image.LANCZOS)
 878: 
 879: 
 880: def _teinte(couleur, p):
 881:     """La couleur eclaircie vers le blanc (p = 1 : blanc)."""
 882:     return tuple(int(round(c + (255 - c) * p)) for c in couleur)
 883: 
 884: 
 885: def _ombre_marge(im, s):
 886:     """im entoure de la marge que demande son ombre, puis ombre (le centre ne bouge pas)."""
 887:     m = int(C.INSERT_OMBRE[0] * C.INSERT_MARGE_OMBRE * s) + 4
 888:     out = Image.new("RGBA", (im.width + 2 * m, im.height + 2 * m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 889:     out.alpha_composite(im, (m, m))
 890:     return _ombre(out, s)
 891: 
 892: 
 893: def _icone_choix(ok, diametre, trait, rubrique):
 894:     """Rond a coche (ok), a croix (non), ou « ? » a la couleur de la rubrique (ok absent : une
 895:     question encore ouverte)."""
 896:     r = diametre / 2
 897:     n = int(2 * r) + 4
 898:     im = Image.new("RGBA", (n, n), (0, 0, 0, 0))
 899:     d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 900:     c = n / 2
 901:     fond = rubrique if ok is None else C.INSERT_VERT if ok else C.INSERT_ROUGE
 902:     d.ellipse([c - r, c - r, c + r, c + r], fill=tuple(fond) + (255,))
 903:     if ok is None:
 904:         _ecrire(d, (c, c), "?", int(r * C.CHOIX_GEO["question"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 905:     elif ok:
 906:         d.line([(c - r * 0.45, c + r * 0.02), (c - r * 0.1, c + r * 0.36), (c + r * 0.48, c - r * 0.3)],
 907:                fill=C.BLANC + (255,), width=trait, joint="curve")
 908:     else:
 909:         k = r * 0.38
 910:         d.line([(c - k, c - k), (c + k, c + k)], fill=C.BLANC + (255,), width=trait)
 911:         d.line([(c - k, c + k), (c + k, c - k)], fill=C.BLANC + (255,), width=trait)
 912:     return im
 913: 
 914: 
 915: def _pointilles(im, periode, plein):
 916:     """Garde un trait sur deux le long de diagonales : un contour devient pointille."""
 917:     masque = Image.new("L", im.size, 0)
 918:     d = ImageDraw.Draw(masque)
 919:     for x in range(-im.height, im.width, periode):
 920:         d.polygon([(x, 0), (x + plein, 0), (x + plein + im.height, im.height), (x + im.height, im.height)], fill=255)
 921:     out = im.copy()
 922:     out.putalpha(ImageChops.multiply(im.getchannel("A"), masque))
 923:     return out
 924: 
 925: 
 926: def _etiquette(lignes, px, padx, pady, couleur=C.INSERT_ROUGE):
 927:     """Etiquette de prix (pointe et trou a gauche), texte blanc ; ni rotation ni ombre."""
 928:     lignes = [T.normaliser(l) for l in lignes]
 929:     lh = px * 1.18
 930:     h = len(lignes) * lh + 2 * pady
 931:     pointe = h * 0.42
 932:     w = max(T.largeur(l, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0) for l in lignes) + 2 * padx + pointe
 933: 
 934:     def dessin(d, k):
 935:         W, H, P = w * k, h * k, pointe * k
 936:         fond = tuple(couleur) + (255,)
 937:         d.rounded_rectangle([P * 0.6, 0, W, H], radius=H * 0.16, fill=fond)
 938:         d.polygon([(P + 1, 0), (0, H / 2), (P + 1, H)], fill=fond)
 939:         r = H * 0.085
 940:         d.ellipse([P * 0.5 - r, H / 2 - r, P * 0.5 + r, H / 2 + r], fill=(0, 0, 0, 0))
 941:     im = _net(w, h, dessin)
 942:     d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
 943:     for i, l in enumerate(lignes):
 944:         _ecrire(d, (pointe + (w - pointe) / 2, pady + lh * (i + 0.5)), l, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
 945:                 C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
 946:     return im
 947: 
 948: 
 949: # -------------------------------------------------------------- frigo
 950: class Frigo(_Insert):
 951:     """L'enceinte refrigeree du cabinet.
 952:     Mode "remplir" : les boites de vaccin tombent sur les etageres ; au temps "prix", une piece
 953:     « € » se pose sur chacune, puis une etiquette claque sur la porte (« Payées d'abord »).
 954:     Mode "releve" : le refrigerateur plein et, a cote, la courbe de temperature qui s'enregistre
 955:     dans la plage de conservation ; l'ecran du refrigerateur affiche la valeur du moment."""
 956: 
 957:     def _releve(self):
 958:         return self.spec.get("mode") == "releve"
 959: 
 960:     def _hauteur_frigo(self):
 961:         return C.FRIGO_RELEVE_H if self._releve() else C.FRIGO_H
 962: 
 963:     def _etiquette(self, s):
 964:         """L'etiquette de prix, deja tournee (sans ombre)."""
 965:         g = C.FRIGO_GEO
 966:         im = _etiquette(self.spec.get("etiquette", []), max(8, int(round(g["etiquette_px"] * s))),
 967:                         g["etiquette_pad"][0] * s, g["etiquette_pad"][1] * s)
 968:         return im.rotate(-g["etiquette_angle"], resample=Image.BICUBIC, expand=True)
 969: 
 970:     def taille_nominale(self):
 971:         fh = self._hauteur_frigo()
 972:         fw = C.FRIGO_W * fh / C.FRIGO_H
 973:         if self._releve():
 974:             return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, fh
 975:         ew = self._etiquette(1.0).width if self.spec.get("etiquette") else 0
 976:         return int(fw + max(0, ew - C.FRIGO_GEO["chevauche"])), fh
 977: 
 978:     def __init__(self, *a):
 979:         super().__init__(*a)
 980:         g = C.FRIGO_GEO
 981:         self.f = self.s * self._hauteur_frigo() / C.FRIGO_H        # echelle de la geometrie FRIGO_GEO
 982:         self.fh = int(round(self._hauteur_frigo() * self.s))
 983:         self.fw = int(round(C.FRIGO_W * self.f))
 984:         q = self.f
 985:         pan, vm, pied = g["panneau"] * q, g["vitre_marge"] * q, g["pied"][1] * q
 986:         self.vitre = (vm, pan + vm, self.fw - 2 * vm - g["poignee"][0] * q, self.fh - pied - vm)
 987:         x0, y0, x1, y1 = self.vitre
 988:         bw, bh = g["boite"][0] * q, g["boite"][1] * q
 989:         ecart = g["boite_ecart"] * q
 990:         rang = (y1 - y0) / 2
 991:         self.places = []                                         # coin haut-gauche de chaque boite
 992:         for r in range(2):
 993:             base = y0 + rang * (r + 1) - g["etagere"] * q
 994:             larg = 3 * bw + 2 * ecart
 995:             for c in range(3):
 996:                 self.places.append((x0 + (x1 - x0 - larg) / 2 + c * (bw + ecart), base - bh))
 997:         self.n = min(len(self.places), int(self.spec.get("doses", len(self.places))))
 998:         self.boite = self._boite(bw, bh)
 999:         self.mf = int(C.INSERT_OMBRE[0] * C.INSERT_MARGE_OMBRE * self.s) + 4     # marge d'ombre
1000:         corps = self._corps(plein=self._releve())
1001:         self.fond_frigo = _ombre_marge(corps, self.s)
1002:         self.masque_vitre = Image.new("L", corps.size, 0)
1003:         ImageDraw.Draw(self.masque_vitre).rounded_rectangle([x0, y0, x1, y1], radius=g["rayon"] * q * 0.5,
1004:                                                              fill=255)
1005:         if self._releve():
1006:             self._init_courbe()
1007:         else:
1008:             p = max(8, int(round(g["piece"] * q)))
1009:             self.piece = _net(p, p, lambda d, k: d.ellipse([0, 0, p * k - 1, p * k - 1],
1010:                                                            fill=C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255,)))
1011:             _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(self.piece), (p / 2, p / 2), "€", max(6, int(round(g["piece_px"] * q))),
1012:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
1013:             self.etiquette = _ombre_marge(self._etiquette(self.s), self.s) if self.spec.get("etiquette") else None
1014: 
1015:     # -- dessin du refrigerateur
1016:     def _boite(self, bw, bh):
1017:         q = self.f
1018: 
1019:         def dessin(d, k):
1020:             W, H = bw * k, bh * k
1021:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, W - 1, H - 1], radius=6 * q * k, fill=C.BLANC + (255,),
1022:                                 outline=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=max(1, int(2 * q * k)))
1023:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, W - 1, H * 0.3], radius=6 * q * k, fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,))
1024:             d.rectangle([0, H * 0.18, W - 1, H * 0.3], fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,))
1025:             for i, frac in enumerate((0.7, 0.45)):
1026:                 y = H * (0.48 + i * 0.16)
1027:                 d.rounded_rectangle([W * 0.16, y, W * (0.16 + frac * 0.7), y + H * 0.07], radius=H * 0.035,
1028:                                     fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,))
1029:         return _net(bw, bh, dessin)
1030: 
1031:     def _corps(self, plein):
1032:         g, q = C.FRIGO_GEO, self.f
1033:         w, h = self.fw, self.fh
1034:         x0, y0, x1, y1 = self.vitre
1035: 
1036:         def dessin(d, k):
1037:             W, H, Q = w * k, h * k, q * k
1038:             pw, ph = g["pied"][0] * Q, g["pied"][1] * Q
1039:             for x in (W * 0.2, W * 0.8):
1040:                 d.rounded_rectangle([x - pw / 2, H - ph - 8 * Q, x + pw / 2, H - 1], radius=4 * Q,
1041:                                     fill=C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,))
1042:             r = g["rayon"] * Q
1043:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, W - 1, H - ph], radius=r, fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1044:             pan = g["panneau"] * Q
1045:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, W - 1, pan + r], radius=r, fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
1046:             d.rectangle([0, pan, W - 1, pan + r], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1047:             ew, eh = g["ecran"][0] * Q, g["ecran"][1] * Q
1048:             d.rounded_rectangle([(W - ew) / 2, (pan - eh) / 2, (W + ew) / 2, (pan + eh) / 2], radius=eh * 0.25,
1049:                                 fill=(8, 5, 26, 255))
1050:             led = 5 * Q
1051:             d.ellipse([r * 0.7 - led, pan / 2 - led, r * 0.7 + led, pan / 2 + led], fill=C.INSERT_VERT + (255,))
1052:             d.ellipse([W - r * 0.7 - led, pan / 2 - led, W - r * 0.7 + led, pan / 2 + led],
1053:                       fill=_teinte(C.NAVY, 0.45) + (255,))
1054:             vx0, vy0, vx1, vy1 = x0 * k, y0 * k, x1 * k, y1 * k
1055:             d.rounded_rectangle([vx0, vy0, vx1, vy1], radius=r * 0.5, fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.86) + (255,))
1056:             lw = vx1 - vx0
1057:             d.polygon([(vx0 + lw * 0.58, vy0), (vx0 + lw * 0.78, vy0), (vx0 + lw * 0.38, vy1), (vx0 + lw * 0.18, vy1)],
1058:                       fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.93) + (255,))
1059:             rang = (vy1 - vy0) / 2
1060:             for i in range(2):
1061:                 y = vy0 + rang * (i + 1) - g["etagere"] * Q
1062:                 d.rectangle([vx0, y, vx1, y + g["etagere"] * Q], fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.6) + (255,))
1063:             gw, gh = g["poignee"][0] * Q, g["poignee"][1] * Q
1064:             gx = vx1 + (W - vx1 - gw) / 2
1065:             d.rounded_rectangle([gx, H * 0.36, gx + gw, H * 0.36 + gh], radius=gw / 2,
1066:                                 fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,))
1067:         im = _net(w, h, dessin)
1068:         if plein:
1069:             for i in range(self.n):
1070:                 im.alpha_composite(self.boite, (int(round(self.places[i][0])), int(round(self.places[i][1]))))
1071:         if not self._releve():
1072:             self._ecran(im, self.spec.get("ecran", "+5 °C"))
1073:         return im
1074: 
1075:     def _ecran(self, im, texte):
1076:         g, q = C.FRIGO_GEO, self.f
1077:         _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(im), (self.fw / 2, g["panneau"] * q / 2), texte, max(6, int(round(g["ecran_px"] * q))),
1078:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, _teinte(C.INSERT_VERT, 0.35) + (255,), "mm")
1079: 
1080:     # -- mode « remplir »
1081:     def _t_boite(self, i):
1082:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.6 + i * C.FRIGO_DECALAGE
1083: 
1084:     def _t_piece(self, i):
1085:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("prix", 1)) + i * C.FRIGO_PIECE_DECALAGE
1086: 
1087:     def _t_etiquette(self):
1088:         return self._t_piece(self.n - 1) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.6
1089: 
1090:     def _remplir(self, frigo, t, final):
1091:         g, q = C.FRIGO_GEO, self.f
1092:         couche = Image.new("RGBA", self.masque_vitre.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
1093:         for i in range(self.n):
1094:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_boite(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1095:             if v <= 0:
1096:                 continue
1097:             x, y = self.places[i]
1098:             if v < 1:                                   # la boite tombe, en accelerant
1099:                 y -= g["chute"] * q * (1 - v * v)
1100:             else:                                       # puis rebondit a peine sur l'etagere
1101:                 w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_boite(i) - C.INSERT_ENTREE) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1102:                 if w2 < 1:
1103:                     y -= 6 * q * math.sin(math.pi * w2) * (1 - w2)
1104:             T.coller(couche, self.boite, (x, y), min(1.0, v * 4))
1105:         couche.putalpha(ImageChops.multiply(couche.getchannel("A"), self.masque_vitre))
1106:         frigo.alpha_composite(couche, (self.mf, self.mf))
1107:         for i in range(self.n):
1108:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_piece(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1109:             if v <= 0:
1110:                 continue
1111:             x, y = self.places[i]
1112:             kk = 0.3 + 0.7 * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
1113:             _poser(frigo, self.piece, self.mf + x + self.boite.width * 0.82, self.mf + y + self.boite.height * 0.12,
1114:                    kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1115: 
1116:     # -- mode « releve »
1117:     @staticmethod
1118:     def _temperature(x):
1119:         """Courbe de demonstration, toujours dans la plage (3,4 a 6,6 °C)."""
1120:         return (5.0 + 0.9 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * (1.3 * x + 0.1)) + 0.45 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * (3.7 * x + 0.3))
1121:                 + 0.2 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 7.1 * x))
1122: 
1123:     def _init_courbe(self):
1124:         g = C.FRIGO_COURBE
1125:         self.cx0 = self.fw + self.px(g["ecart"])                 # gauche de la carte, dans la boite
1126:         cw, ch = self.w - self.cx0, self.h
1127:         pad = self.px(g["pad"])
1128:         carte = _cadre(cw, ch, self.s, marge=self.m)
1129:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1130:         m = self.m
1131:         _ecrire(d, (m + pad, m + pad), self.spec.get("titre", "Température enregistrée"), self.px(g["titre_px"]),
1132:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (255,))
1133:         axe = self.px(g["axe_px"])
1134:         lab_w = T.largeur("+8 °C", axe, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, 0) + pad * 0.6
1135:         self.zone = (m + pad + lab_w, m + pad + self.px(g["titre_px"]) * 1.9, m + cw - pad, m + ch - pad)
1136:         zx0, zy0, zx1, zy1 = self.zone
1137:         lo, hi = g["plage"]
1138:         ya, yb = self._y(hi), self._y(lo)
1139:         d.rectangle([zx0, ya, zx1, yb], fill=_teinte(C.INSERT_VERT, 0.85) + (255,))
1140:         for y, v in ((ya, hi), (yb, lo)):
1141:             for x in range(int(zx0), int(zx1), self.px(14)):
1142:                 d.line([(x, y), (min(zx1, x + self.px(8)), y)], fill=C.INSERT_VERT + (255,), width=max(1, self.px(3)))
1143:             _ecrire(d, (zx0 - pad * 0.4, y), f"+{v}{NBSP}°C", axe, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.INSERT_VERT + (255,), "rm")
1144:         self.carte_courbe = _ombre(carte, self.s)
1145:         self.rec_px = self.px(g["rec_px"])
1146:         self.rec_xy = (m + cw - pad, m + pad + self.px(g["titre_px"]) * 0.55)
1147: 
1148:     def _y(self, v):
1149:         zx0, zy0, zx1, zy1 = self.zone
1150:         e0, e1 = C.FRIGO_COURBE["echelle"]
1151:         return zy1 - (v - e0) / (e1 - e0) * (zy1 - zy0)
1152: 
1153:     def _t_courbe(self):
1154:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 1.2
1155: 
1156:     def _courbe(self, t, final):
1157:         """La carte de la courbe, tracee jusqu'a p ; et la temperature du moment."""
1158:         g = C.FRIGO_COURBE
1159:         p = 1.0 if final else max(0.0, min(1.0, (t - self._t_courbe()) / g["duree"]))
1160:         carte = self.carte_courbe.copy()
1161:         zx0, zy0, zx1, zy1 = self.zone
1162:         if p > 0:
1163:             n = max(2, int(120 * p))
1164:             pts = [(zx0 + (zx1 - zx0) * p * i / (n - 1), self._y(self._temperature(p * i / (n - 1))))
1165:                    for i in range(n)]
1166: 
1167:             def dessin(d, k):
1168:                 d.line([(x * k, y * k) for x, y in pts], fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,),
1169:                        width=max(2, int(self.px(g["trait"]) * k)), joint="curve")
1170:                 r = self.px(g["tete"]) * k
1171:                 x, y = pts[-1][0] * k, pts[-1][1] * k
1172:                 d.ellipse([x - r, y - r, x + r, y + r], fill=C.BLANC + (255,), outline=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,),
1173:                           width=max(2, int(self.px(4) * k)))
1174:             carte.alpha_composite(_net(carte.width, carte.height, dessin))
1175:         # pastille rouge qui clignote : l'enregistrement ne s'arrete pas
1176:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1177:         allume = final or (t * 2) % 2 < 1.3
1178:         x, y = self.rec_xy
1179:         r = self.rec_px * 0.36
1180:         d.ellipse([x - 2 * r, y - r, x, y + r], fill=C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255 if allume else 60,))
1181:         return carte, self._temperature(p)
1182: 
1183:     def image(self, t, final):
1184:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0))) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1185:         if u <= 0:
1186:             return None
1187:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1188:         frigo = self.fond_frigo.copy()
1189:         if self._releve():
1190:             carte, temp = self._courbe(t, final)
1191:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1192:             if v > 0:
1193:                 dx = 0 if final else C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(v))
1194:                 _poser(out, carte, self.cx0 + carte.width / 2 + dx, self.m + self.h / 2,
1195:                        1.0, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1196:             ecran = Image.new("RGBA", frigo.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
1197:             self._ecran_sur(ecran, f"+{temp:.1f}{NBSP}°C".replace(".", ","))
1198:             frigo.alpha_composite(ecran)
1199:         else:
1200:             self._remplir(frigo, t, final)
1201:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1202:         _poser(out, frigo, self.m + self.fw / 2, self.m + self.h - self.fh / 2, k,
1203:                1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1204:         if not self._releve() and self.etiquette is not None:
1205:             v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_etiquette()) / C.TAMPON_FRAPPE
1206:             if v > 0:
1207:                 kk = 1.0 if final or v >= 1 else C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - (C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - 1) * v * v
1208:                 dx = 0.0
1209:                 if not final and v > 1:
1210:                     w2 = (t - self._t_etiquette() - C.TAMPON_FRAPPE) / C.TAMPON_SECOUSSE[1]
1211:                     if w2 < 1:
1212:                         dx = C.TAMPON_SECOUSSE[0] * self.s * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 4 * w2) * (1 - w2)
1213:                 g = C.FRIGO_GEO
1214:                 cx = self.m + self.fw - g["chevauche"] * self.s + (self.etiquette.width - 2 * self.mf) / 2 + dx
1215:                 cy = self.m + self.h - self.fh + self.fh * g["etiquette_y"]
1216:                 _poser(out, self.etiquette, cx, cy, kk, 1.0 if final else min(1.0, v * C.TAMPON_GEO["fondu"]))
1217:         return out
1218: 
1219:     def _ecran_sur(self, im, texte):
1220:         g, q = C.FRIGO_GEO, self.f
1221:         _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(im), (self.mf + self.fw / 2, self.mf + g["panneau"] * q / 2), texte,
1222:                 max(6, int(round(g["ecran_px"] * q))), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, _teinte(C.INSERT_VERT, 0.35) + (255,), "mm")
1223: 
1224:     def sons(self):
1225:         t0 = self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0))
1226:         if self._releve():
1227:             return [(t0, "clic"), (self._t_courbe(), "compteur")]
1228:         out = [(self._t_boite(0), "compteur"), (self._t_piece(0), "compteur")]
1229:         if self.etiquette is not None:
1230:             out.append((self._t_etiquette() + C.TAMPON_FRAPPE, "impact"))
1231:         return out
1232: 
1233: 
1234: # ------------------------------------------------------------- ticket
1235: class Ticket(_Insert):
1236:     """Un ticket de facturation qui s'imprime ligne par ligne ; chaque ligne recoit une coche ou
1237:     une croix, et sa valeur a droite (« remboursée », « pas à part »)."""
1238: 
1239:     def taille_nominale(self):
1240:         g = C.TICKET_GEO
1241:         n = len(self.spec["lignes"])
1242:         return C.TICKET_W + 2 * g["fente_deborde"], g["fente_h"] + g["tete"] + n * g["ligne_h"] + g["pad"] + g["dents"]
1243: 
1244:     def __init__(self, *a):
1245:         super().__init__(*a)
1246:         g = C.TICKET_GEO
1247:         self.lignes = self.spec["lignes"]
1248:         self.pw = self.px(C.TICKET_W)
1249:         self.fente = (self.px(g["fente_h"]), self.px(g["fente_deborde"]))
1250:         self.tete, self.lh, self.pad = self.px(g["tete"]), self.px(g["ligne_h"]), self.px(g["pad"])
1251:         self.dents = self.px(g["dents"])
1252:         ph = self.tete + len(self.lignes) * self.lh + self.pad
1253:         papier = Image.new("RGBA", (self.pw, ph), C.BLANC + (255,))
1254:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(papier)
1255:         _ecrire(d, (self.pw / 2, self.tete * 0.55), T.normaliser(self.spec.get("titre", "")).upper(),
1256:                 self.px(g["titre_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
1257:         self.icone_x = self.pad + self.px(g["icone"]) / 2
1258:         for i, l in enumerate(self.lignes):
1259:             y = self.tete + i * self.lh
1260:             for x in range(self.pad, self.pw - self.pad, self.px(16)):     # pointilles d'imprimante
1261:                 d.line([(x, y), (x + self.px(8), y)], fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=max(1, self.px(3)))
1262:             cy = y + self.lh / 2
1263:             # le libelle se resserre plutot que de toucher la valeur, alignee a droite
1264:             x_label = self.pad + self.px(g["icone"]) + self.px(18)
1265:             place = (self.pw - self.pad - x_label - self.px(g["ecart_valeur"])
1266:                      - T.largeur(T.normaliser(l.get("valeur", "")), self.px(g["valeur_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0))
1267:             px = self.px(g["label_px"])
1268:             while px > self.px(g["label_px_min"]) and \
1269:                     T.largeur(T.normaliser(l["label"]), px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, 0) > place:
1270:                 px -= 1
1271:             _ecrire(d, (x_label, cy), l["label"], px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "lm")
1272:             couleur = C.INSERT_VERT if l.get("ok") else C.INSERT_ROUGE
1273:             _ecrire(d, (self.pw - self.pad, cy), l.get("valeur", ""), self.px(g["valeur_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1274:                     couleur + (255,), "rm")
1275:         self.papier = papier
1276:         self.icones = [_icone_choix(l.get("ok"), self.px(g["icone"]), self.px(g["trait_icone"]), self.rubrique)
1277:                        for l in self.lignes]
1278:         fw, fh = self.pw + 2 * self.fente[1], self.fente[0]
1279: 
1280:         def dessin(d, k):
1281:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, fw * k - 1, fh * k - 1], radius=fh * k / 2, fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
1282:             d.rounded_rectangle([fh * k * 0.6, fh * k * 0.42, (fw - fh * 0.6) * k, fh * k * 0.62], radius=fh * k * 0.1,
1283:                                 fill=(8, 5, 26, 255))
1284:         self.imprimante = _ombre_marge(_net(fw, fh, dessin), self.s)
1285: 
1286:     def _t_ligne(self, i):
1287:         l = self.lignes[i]
1288:         precedentes = [j for j in range(i) if self.lignes[j].get("temps", 0) == l.get("temps", 0)]
1289:         return self.t0(l.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE + len(precedentes) * C.TICKET_GEO["avance"] * 1.3
1290: 
1291:     def _longueur(self, t, final):
1292:         if final:
1293:             return self.papier.height
1294:         a = C.TICKET_GEO["avance"]
1295:         L = self.tete * T.lisse((t - self.t0() - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.4) / a)
1296:         for i in range(len(self.lignes)):
1297:             L += self.lh * T.lisse((t - self._t_ligne(i)) / a)
1298:         if len(self.lignes):
1299:             L += self.pad * T.lisse((t - self._t_ligne(len(self.lignes) - 1) - a) / a)
1300:         return int(round(L))
1301: 
1302:     def image(self, t, final):
1303:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1304:         if u <= 0:
1305:             return None
1306:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1307:         L = self._longueur(t, final)
1308:         x0 = self.m + self.fente[1]
1309:         y0 = self.m + self.fente[0] / 2
1310:         if L > 0:
1311:             dents = self.dents
1312:             bande = Image.new("RGBA", (self.pw, L + dents), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1313:             bande.alpha_composite(self.papier.crop((0, 0, self.pw, L)))
1314:             n = max(2, self.pw // max(4, dents))
1315: 
1316:             def dessin(d, k):
1317:                 pas = self.pw * k / n
1318:                 pts = [(0, 0)]
1319:                 for i in range(n):
1320:                     pts += [(pas * (i + 0.5), dents * k * 0.95), (pas * (i + 1), 0)]
1321:                 d.polygon(pts, fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1322:             bande.alpha_composite(_net(self.pw, dents, dessin), (0, L))
1323:             for i, l in enumerate(self.lignes):              # l'icone tombe quand sa ligne est sortie
1324:                 v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_ligne(i) - C.TICKET_GEO["avance"] * 0.8) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1325:                 cy = self.tete + (i + 0.5) * self.lh
1326:                 if v > 0 and cy < L:
1327:                     kk = C.CHOIX_GEO["icone_depart"] + (1 - C.CHOIX_GEO["icone_depart"]) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
1328:                     _poser(bande, self.icones[i], self.icone_x, cy, kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1329:             _poser(out, _ombre_marge(bande, self.s), x0 + self.pw / 2, y0 + (L + dents) / 2)
1330:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1331:         _poser(out, self.imprimante, self.m + self.w / 2, self.m + self.fente[0] / 2, k,
1332:                1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1333:         return out
1334: 
1335:     def sons(self):
1336:         return [(self.t0() + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.4, "souffle")] + [(self._t_ligne(i), "clic")
1337:                                                                     for i in range(len(self.lignes))]
1338: 
1339: 
1340: # -------------------------------------------------------------- appel
1341: class Appel(_Insert):
1342:     """Ce qui arrive d'abord : un telephone qui sonne dans sa carte, une fleche, puis le
1343:     courrier qui vole jusqu'a la sienne."""
1344: 
1345:     def taille_nominale(self):
1346:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.APPEL_H
1347: 
1348:     def __init__(self, *a):
1349:         super().__init__(*a)
1350:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1351:         self.etapes = self.spec["etapes"][:2]
1352:         self.ecart = self.px(g["ecart"])
1353:         self.cw = (self.w - self.ecart) // 2
1354:         self.cartes = [self._carte(e) for e in self.etapes]
1355:         self.icones = [self._icone(e.get("icone")) for e in self.etapes]
1356:         self.ondes = self._ondes()
1357: 
1358:     def _icone(self, nom):
1359:         return {"telephone": self._telephone, "infirmier": self._infirmier}.get(nom, self._enveloppe)()
1360: 
1361:     def _infirmier(self):
1362:         """Un soignant en buste, la croix du soin sur la poitrine (l'infirmier en pratique avancee)."""
1363:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1364:         w, h = self.px(g["infirmier"][0]), self.px(g["infirmier"][1])
1365:         rub = tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,)
1366: 
1367:         def dessin(d, k):
1368:             W, H = w * k, h * k
1369:             r = W * 0.2
1370:             d.ellipse([W / 2 - r, 0, W / 2 + r, 2 * r], fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
1371:             d.rounded_rectangle([W * 0.08, H * 0.42, W * 0.92, H - 1], radius=W * 0.3, fill=rub)
1372:             c, l, e = (W / 2, H * 0.7), W * 0.26, W * 0.08
1373:             d.rectangle([c[0] - l / 2, c[1] - e / 2, c[0] + l / 2, c[1] + e / 2], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1374:             d.rectangle([c[0] - e / 2, c[1] - l / 2, c[0] + e / 2, c[1] + l / 2], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1375:         return _net(w, h, dessin)
1376: 
1377:     def _carte(self, e):
1378:         g, m = C.APPEL_GEO, self.m
1379:         im = _cadre(self.cw, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1380:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
1381:         pad = self.px(g["pad"])
1382:         px, pn = self.px(g["label_px"]), self.px(g["note_px"])
1383:         lignes = _couper(e["label"], px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, self.cw - 2 * pad)
1384:         note = e.get("note")
1385:         bas = m + self.h - pad - (pn * 1.3 if note else 0)
1386:         for i, l in enumerate(reversed(lignes)):
1387:             _ecrire(d, (m + self.cw / 2, bas - i * px * 1.18), l, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "ms")
1388:         if note:
1389:             _ecrire(d, (m + self.cw / 2, m + self.h - pad), note, pn, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE,
1390:                     C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "ms")
1391:         return _ombre(im, self.s)
1392: 
1393:     def _telephone(self):
1394:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1395:         w, h = self.px(g["telephone"][0]), self.px(g["telephone"][1])
1396: 
1397:         def dessin(d, k):
1398:             W, H = w * k, h * k
1399:             d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, W - 1, H - 1], radius=W * 0.2, fill=C.NAVY + (255,))
1400:             b = W * 0.08
1401:             d.rounded_rectangle([b, b * 1.6, W - b, H - b * 1.6], radius=W * 0.12, fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,))
1402:             r = W * 0.17
1403:             d.ellipse([W / 2 - r, H * 0.3 - r, W / 2 + r, H * 0.3 + r], fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.75) + (255,))
1404:             rb = W * 0.11
1405:             for x, c in ((W * 0.3, C.INSERT_ROUGE), (W * 0.7, C.INSERT_VERT)):
1406:                 d.ellipse([x - rb, H * 0.76 - rb, x + rb, H * 0.76 + rb], fill=c + (255,))
1407:             d.rounded_rectangle([W * 0.38, b * 0.55, W * 0.62, b * 1.05], radius=b * 0.25, fill=(8, 5, 26, 255))
1408:         return _net(w, h, dessin)
1409: 
1410:     def _enveloppe(self):
1411:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1412:         w, h = self.px(g["enveloppe"][0]), self.px(g["enveloppe"][1])
1413:         tr = self.px(g["trait"])
1414: 
1415:         def dessin(d, k):
1416:             W, H, e = w * k, h * k, tr * k
1417:             d.rounded_rectangle([e / 2, e / 2, W - e / 2, H - e / 2], radius=W * 0.06, fill=C.BLANC + (255,),
1418:                                 outline=C.NAVY + (255,), width=int(e))
1419:             d.line([(e, e), (W / 2, H * 0.58), (W - e, e)], fill=C.NAVY + (255,), width=int(e), joint="curve")
1420:             r = H * 0.14
1421:             d.ellipse([W - r * 1.6 - r, -0, W - r * 1.6 + r, 2 * r], fill=C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255,))
1422:         return _net(w, h, dessin)
1423: 
1424:     def _ondes(self):
1425:         """Les ondes de la sonnerie, de part et d'autre du telephone."""
1426:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1427:         tw, th = self.px(g["telephone"][0]), self.px(g["telephone"][1])
1428:         w, h = tw * 2.2, th * 0.8
1429:         tr = self.px(g["trait"])
1430: 
1431:         def dessin(d, k):
1432:             W, H = w * k, h * k
1433:             for i in range(g["ondes"]):
1434:                 r = (tw * 0.62 + i * tr * 2.6) * k
1435:                 box = [W / 2 - r, H / 2 - r, W / 2 + r, H / 2 + r]
1436:                 for a0 in (-35, 145):
1437:                     d.arc(box, a0, a0 + 70, fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,), width=int(tr * k))
1438:         return _net(w, h, dessin)
1439: 
1440:     def _t(self, i):
1441:         if "temps" in self.etapes[i]:                    # une etape peut attendre son temps du texte
1442:             return self.t0(self.etapes[i]["temps"])
1443:         t = self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0))
1444:         return t if i == 0 else t + C.APPEL_GEO["courrier"]
1445: 
1446:     def image(self, t, final):
1447:         g = C.APPEL_GEO
1448:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1449:         for i, carte in enumerate(self.cartes):
1450:             u = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i)) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1451:             if u <= 0:
1452:                 continue
1453:             k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1454:             dx = 0 if final or i == 0 else C.INSERT_MONTEE * self.s * (1 - T.lisse(u))
1455:             cx = self.m + i * (self.cw + self.ecart) + self.cw / 2
1456:             _poser(out, carte, cx + dx, self.m + self.h / 2, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1457:             iy = self.m + self.px(g["icone_y"])
1458:             icone, angle, ix = self.icones[i], 0.0, cx + dx
1459:             if self.etapes[i].get("icone") == "telephone":
1460:                 tau = 0.0 if final else t - self._t(i) - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.4
1461:                 sonne = not final and 0 < tau < g["sonnerie"] and (tau % 0.65) < 0.45
1462:                 if sonne:
1463:                     angle = g["secousse"] * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 14 * tau)
1464:                     _poser(out, self.ondes, ix, iy, 1.0, 0.55 + 0.45 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 3 * tau) ** 2)
1465:             elif self.etapes[i].get("icone") != "infirmier":   # le courrier arrive en vol, de la droite
1466:                 v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t(i) - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.3) / (C.INSERT_ENTREE * 1.4)
1467:                 if v <= 0:
1468:                     continue
1469:                 p = 1.0 if final else T.rebond(v)
1470:                 ix += (1 - p) * self.px(260)
1471:                 iy -= (1 - p) * self.px(90)
1472:                 angle = -22 * (1 - p)
1473:             _poser(out, icone, ix, iy, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU), angle)
1474:         if len(self.cartes) == 2:                         # la fleche se trace d'une carte a l'autre
1475:             p = 1.0 if final else (t - (self._t(1) - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.6)) / (C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.6)
1476:             x0 = self.m + self.cw + self.ecart * 0.2
1477:             x1 = self.m + self.cw + self.ecart * 0.8
1478:             fl = Image.new("RGBA", out.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
1479:             _fleche(ImageDraw.Draw(fl), x0, x1, self.m + self.h / 2, p, self.px(C.CIRCUIT_GEO["trait"]),
1480:                     self.px(C.CIRCUIT_GEO["tete"]), C.BLANC + (255,))
1481:             out.alpha_composite(_ombre(fl, self.s))
1482:         return out
1483: 
1484:     def sons(self):
1485:         return [(self._t(0), "clic")] + ([(self._t(1), "souffle")] if len(self.cartes) == 2 else [])
1486: 
1487: 
1488: # -------------------------------------------------------------- loupe
1489: class Loupe(_Insert):
1490:     """Une page qu'on fouille : la recherche se tape, la loupe balaie la page, rien ne sort."""
1491: 
1492:     def taille_nominale(self):
1493:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.LOUPE_H
1494: 
1495:     def __init__(self, *a):
1496:         super().__init__(*a)
1497:         g = C.LOUPE_GEO
1498:         m = self.m
1499:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1500:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1501:         barre = self.px(g["barre"])
1502:         rayon = max(4, int(C.INSERT_RAYON * self.s))
1503:         gris = _teinte(C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE, 0.82)
1504:         d.rounded_rectangle([m, m, m + self.w - 1, m + barre], radius=rayon, fill=gris + (255,))
1505:         d.rectangle([m, m + barre - rayon, m + self.w - 1, m + barre], fill=gris + (255,))
1506:         r = self.px(g["point"])
1507:         for i in range(3):
1508:             x = m + self.px(28) + i * r * 3
1509:             d.ellipse([x - r, m + barre / 2 - r, x + r, m + barre / 2 + r], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1510:         upx = self.px(g["url_px"])
1511:         url = T.normaliser(self.spec.get("site", ""))
1512:         uw = T.largeur(url, upx, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, 0) + 2 * self.px(g["url_pad"])
1513:         ux = m + self.px(28) + r * 9
1514:         d.rounded_rectangle([ux, m + barre * 0.2, ux + uw, m + barre * 0.8], radius=barre * 0.3, fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
1515:         _ecrire(d, (ux + uw / 2, m + barre / 2), url, upx, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
1516:         pad = self.px(28)
1517:         ch = self.px(g["champ_h"])
1518:         self.champ = (m + pad, m + barre + self.px(g["champ_y"]), m + self.w - pad, m + barre + self.px(g["champ_y"]) + ch)
1519:         x0, y0, x1, y1 = self.champ
1520:         d.rounded_rectangle([x0, y0, x1, y1], radius=ch / 2, outline=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=max(2, self.px(4)))
1521:         self.fond = _ombre(carte, self.s)
1522:         self.petite = self._loupe(ch * 0.18, max(2, self.px(4)), C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE)
1523:         self.grande = self._loupe(self.px(g["loupe"]), self.px(g["trait"]), C.NAVY, vitre=True)
1524:         self.zone = (x0, y1, x1, m + self.h)                       # sous le champ : la page
1525: 
1526:     def _loupe(self, r, trait, couleur, vitre=False):
1527:         taille = r * 3.3
1528: 
1529:         def dessin(d, k):
1530:             R, e, c = r * k, trait * k, taille * k * 0.38
1531:             if vitre:
1532:                 d.ellipse([c - R, c - R, c + R, c + R], fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.82) + (150,))
1533:             d.ellipse([c - R, c - R, c + R, c + R], outline=tuple(couleur) + (255,), width=int(e))
1534:             a = c + R * 0.72
1535:             d.line([(a, a), (taille * k * 0.92, taille * k * 0.92)], fill=tuple(couleur) + (255,), width=int(e * 1.5))
1536:         return _net(taille, taille, dessin)
1537: 
1538:     def _temps(self):
1539:         g = C.LOUPE_GEO
1540:         t0 = self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5
1541:         return t0, t0 + g["frappe"], t0 + g["frappe"] + g["balayage"]
1542: 
1543:     def image(self, t, final):
1544:         g = C.LOUPE_GEO
1545:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0))) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1546:         if u <= 0:
1547:             return None
1548:         carte = self.fond.copy()
1549:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1550:         frappe, balai, fin = self._temps()
1551:         x0, y0, x1, y1 = self.champ
1552:         ch = y1 - y0
1553:         _poser(carte, self.petite, x0 + ch * 0.62, (y0 + y1) / 2 + ch * 0.04)
1554:         texte = T.normaliser(self.spec.get("recherche", ""))
1555:         n = len(texte) if final else int(len(texte) * max(0.0, min(1.0, (t - frappe) / g["frappe"])))
1556:         px = self.px(g["champ_px"])
1557:         tx = x0 + ch * 1.15
1558:         _ecrire(d, (tx, (y0 + y1) / 2), texte[:n], px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "lm")
1559:         if not final and t < fin and (t % g["curseur"]) < g["curseur"] * 0.55:
1560:             xc = tx + T.largeur(texte[:n], px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, 0) + self.px(4)
1561:             d.line([(xc, (y0 + y1) / 2 - px * 0.6), (xc, (y0 + y1) / 2 + px * 0.6)], fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,),
1562:                    width=max(2, self.px(4)))
1563:         zx0, zy0, zx1, zy1 = self.zone
1564:         cx, cy = (zx0 + zx1) / 2, (zy0 + zy1) / 2
1565:         if not final and balai < t < fin + C.INSERT_ENTREE:      # la loupe cherche, en huit
1566:             tau = (t - balai) / g["balayage"]
1567:             a = min(1.0, (t - balai) / C.INSERT_ENTREE) * min(1.0, max(0.0, (fin + C.INSERT_ENTREE - t) / C.INSERT_ENTREE))
1568:             lx = cx + (zx1 - zx0) * 0.3 * math.sin(2 * math.pi * tau)
1569:             ly = cy + (zy1 - zy0) * 0.16 * math.sin(4 * math.pi * tau)
1570:             _poser(carte, self.grande, lx + self.grande.width * 0.12, ly + self.grande.height * 0.12, 1.0, a)
1571:         v = 1.0 if final else (t - fin) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1572:         if v > 0:
1573:             _ecrire(d, (cx, zy0 + (zy1 - zy0) * g["vide_y"]), self.spec.get("vide", ""), self.px(g["vide_px"]),
1574:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1575:                     C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (int(255 * min(1.0, v)),), "mm")
1576:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1577:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1578:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1579:         return out
1580: 
1581:     def sons(self):
1582:         frappe, balai, _ = self._temps()
1583:         return [(frappe, "compteur"), (balai, "souffle")]
1584: 
1585: 
1586: # ------------------------------------------------------------- calcul
1587: class Calcul(_Insert):
1588:     """Le calcul qui cible les medecins : la barre se remplit ; au temps "temps_question", la part
1589:     marquee "question" se detache vers le haut, son empreinte en pointille, un « ? » au-dessus."""
1590: 
1591:     def taille_nominale(self):
1592:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.CALCUL_H
1593: 
1594:     def __init__(self, *a):
1595:         super().__init__(*a)
1596:         g = C.CALCUL_GEO
1597:         m, pad = self.m, self.px(g["pad"])
1598:         self.parts = self.spec["parts"]
1599:         total = sum(p["valeur"] for p in self.parts)
1600:         self.bx0, self.bx1 = m + pad, m + self.w - pad
1601:         self.by, self.bh = m + self.px(g["barre_y"]), self.px(g["barre_h"])
1602:         bw = self.bx1 - self.bx0
1603:         bornes, x = [], 0.0
1604:         for p in self.parts:
1605:             bornes.append((x, x + bw * p["valeur"] / total))
1606:             x = bornes[-1][1]
1607:         self.bornes = bornes
1608:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1609:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1610:         _ecrire(d, (m + pad, m + pad), self.spec.get("titre", ""), self.px(g["titre_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1611:                 C.NAVY + (255,))
1612:         d.rounded_rectangle([self.bx0, self.by, self.bx1, self.by + self.bh], radius=self.bh / 2,
1613:                             fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,))
1614:         self.fond = carte
1615:         self.segments = [self._segment(i) for i in range(len(self.parts))]
1616:         self.labels = self._labels()
1617:         b = self.px(g["badge"])
1618:         badge = _net(2 * b, 2 * b, lambda dd, k: dd.ellipse([0, 0, 2 * b * k - 1, 2 * b * k - 1], fill=C.NAVY + (255,)))
1619:         _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(badge), (b, b), "?", int(b * 1.25), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
1620:         self.badge = _ombre_marge(badge, self.s)
1621:         self.question = next((i for i, p in enumerate(self.parts) if p.get("question")), None)
1622:         if self.question is not None:
1623:             a, b2 = self.bornes[self.question]
1624:             empreinte = _net(b2 - a, self.bh, lambda dd, k: dd.rounded_rectangle(
1625:                 [0, 0, (b2 - a) * k - 1, self.bh * k - 1], radius=self.bh * k / 2 if self.question == len(self.parts) - 1 else 0,
1626:                 outline=C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), width=int(self.px(4) * k)))
1627:             self.empreinte = _pointilles(empreinte, *[self.px(v) for v in g["pointille"]])
1628: 
1629:     def _ton(self, p):
1630:         """Couleur d'une part : "ton" rouge ou vert (une regle defavorable ou favorable) ; "bleu",
1631:         ou pas de ton, la rubrique. Un libelle ne prend la couleur de sa part que si elle porte un
1632:         ton."""
1633:         return {"rouge": C.INSERT_ROUGE, "vert": C.INSERT_VERT}.get(p.get("ton"), tuple(self.rubrique))
1634: 
1635:     def _segment(self, i):
1636:         """Le segment i, arrondi a ses bouts exterieurs ; raye s'il porte la question."""
1637:         g = C.CALCUL_GEO
1638:         a, b = self.bornes[i]
1639:         w, h = b - a, self.bh
1640:         premier, dernier = i == 0, i == len(self.parts) - 1
1641:         question = self.parts[i].get("question")
1642: 
1643:         def dessin(d, k):
1644:             W, H = w * k, h * k
1645:             couleur = _teinte(self.rubrique, 0.45) if question else self._ton(self.parts[i])
1646:             gauche = 0 if premier else -H
1647:             droite = W if dernier else W + H
1648:             d.rounded_rectangle([gauche, 0, droite - 1, H - 1], radius=H / 2, fill=couleur + (255,))
1649:             if question:
1650:                 pas = self.px(g["rayures"]) * k
1651:                 x = -H
1652:                 while x < W:
1653:                     d.line([(x, H), (x + H, 0)], fill=_teinte(self.rubrique, 0.68) + (255,), width=int(pas * 0.4))
1654:                     x += pas
1655:         return _net(w, h, dessin)
1656: 
1657:     def _labels(self):
1658:         g = C.CALCUL_GEO
1659:         px = self.px(g["label_px"])
1660:         y = self.by + self.bh + self.px(g["accolade_y"])
1661:         out = []
1662:         for i, p in enumerate(self.parts):
1663:             a, b = self.bornes[i]
1664:             dernier = i == len(self.parts) - 1
1665:             im = Image.new("RGBA", self.fond.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
1666:             d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
1667:             couleur = (self._ton(p) if p.get("ton") else C.NAVY if p.get("question") else C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE) + (255,)
1668:             tr = max(2, self.px(3))
1669:             d.line([(self.bx0 + a + tr, y), (self.bx0 + b - tr, y)], fill=couleur, width=tr)
1670:             for x in (self.bx0 + a + tr, self.bx0 + b - tr):
1671:                 d.line([(x, y - self.px(10)), (x, y)], fill=couleur, width=tr)
1672:             ancre, x = ("rt", self.bx0 + b) if dernier else ("lt", self.bx0 + a)
1673:             _ecrire(d, (x, y + self.px(10)), p["label"], px,
1674:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE if p.get("question") else C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, couleur, ancre)
1675:             out.append(im)
1676:         return out
1677: 
1678:     def _t_question(self):
1679:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps_question", 1)) + C.INSERT_DELAI
1680: 
1681:     def image(self, t, final):
1682:         g = C.CALCUL_GEO
1683:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1684:         if u <= 0:
1685:             return None
1686:         carte = self.fond.copy()
1687:         p = 1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - self.t0() - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5) / g["remplissage"])
1688:         bw = self.bx1 - self.bx0
1689:         rempli = bw * p
1690:         v = 0.0 if self.question is None else (1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - self._t_question()) / C.INSERT_ENTREE))
1691:         for i, seg in enumerate(self.segments):
1692:             a, b = self.bornes[i]
1693:             if rempli <= a:
1694:                 continue
1695:             vis = seg.crop((0, 0, max(1, int(round(min(b, rempli) - a))), seg.height))
1696:             if i == self.question and v > 0:
1697:                 carte.alpha_composite(self.empreinte, (int(round(self.bx0 + a)), int(round(self.by))))
1698:                 dy = -self.px(g["levee"]) * v
1699:                 flotte = 0.0 if final else self.px(g["flotte"]) * math.sin(2 * math.pi * 0.8 * (t - self._t_question())) * v
1700:                 cx = self.bx0 + (a + b) / 2
1701:                 cy = self.by + self.bh / 2 + dy + flotte
1702:                 _poser(carte, _ombre_marge(vis, self.s), cx, cy, 1.0, 1.0, g["angle"] * v)
1703:                 w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_question() - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1704:                 if w2 > 0:
1705:                     kk = 0.3 + 0.7 * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(w2))
1706:                     _poser(carte, self.badge, self.bx0 + b - self.px(g["badge"]) * 0.6,
1707:                            cy - self.bh / 2 - self.px(g["badge"]) * 0.7, kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(w2 * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1708:             else:
1709:                 carte.alpha_composite(vis, (int(round(self.bx0 + a)), int(round(self.by))))
1710:         for i, lab in enumerate(self.labels):
1711:             w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0() - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5 - g["remplissage"] * (i + 1) / len(self.labels)) \
1712:                 / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1713:             if w2 > 0:
1714:                 T.coller(carte, lab, (0, 0), min(1.0, w2))
1715:         carte = _ombre(carte, self.s)
1716:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1717:         k = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1718:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1719:         return out
1720: 
1721:     def sons(self):
1722:         out = [(self.t0() + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5, "souffle")]
1723:         if self.question is not None:
1724:             out += [(self._t_question(), "clic"), (self._t_question() + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5, "impact")]
1725:         return out
1726: 
1727: 
1728: def _ton(spec, rubrique):
1729:     """Couleur d'un element : "ton" rouge, vert, ou la rubrique."""
1730:     return {"rouge": C.INSERT_ROUGE, "vert": C.INSERT_VERT}.get(spec.get("ton"), tuple(rubrique))
1731: 
1732: 
1733: def _bulle(texte, px, h, pad, couleur, queue=True):
1734:     """Pilule de couleur, texte blanc, avec une pointe dessous (une bulle qui designe)."""
1735:     w = int(T.largeur(T.normaliser(texte), px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, 0) + 2 * pad)
1736:     q = h * 0.32 if queue else 0
1737: 
1738:     def dessin(d, k):
1739:         d.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, w * k - 1, h * k - 1], radius=h * k / 2, fill=tuple(couleur) + (255,))
1740:         if queue:
1741:             d.polygon([(w * k / 2 - q * k, h * k - 2), (w * k / 2 + q * k, h * k - 2), (w * k / 2, (h + q) * k)],
1742:                       fill=tuple(couleur) + (255,))
1743:     im = _net(w, h + q, dessin)
1744:     _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(im), (w / 2, h / 2), texte, px, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
1745:     return im
1746: 
1747: 
1748: def _entree(t, t0, final):
1749:     """(echelle, opacite) d'un element qui arrive en rebond a t0."""
1750:     u = 1.0 if final else (t - t0) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
1751:     if u <= 0:
1752:         return 0.0, 0.0
1753:     return (C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u)),
1754:             1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1755: 
1756: 
1757: # --------------------------------------------------------------- ages
1758: class Ages(_Insert):
1759:     """La regle des ages : trois zones colorees, un curseur « vous » qui va de zone en zone (dans
1760:     l'ordre de "ordre") ; a chaque arret, une bulle dit ce que devient la pension dans cette zone."""
1761: 
1762:     def taille_nominale(self):
1763:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.AGES_H
1764: 
1765:     def __init__(self, *a):
1766:         super().__init__(*a)
1767:         g, m = C.AGES_GEO, self.m
1768:         pad = self.px(g["pad"])
1769:         self.zones = self.spec["zones"]
1770:         n = len(self.zones)
1771:         self.x0, self.x1 = m + pad, m + self.w - pad
1772:         self.ry = m + self.px(g["regle_y"])
1773:         rh, ecart = self.px(g["regle_h"]), self.px(g["ecart"])
1774:         larg = (self.x1 - self.x0 - (n - 1) * ecart) / n
1775:         self.bornes = [(self.x0 + i * (larg + ecart), self.x0 + i * (larg + ecart) + larg) for i in range(n)]
1776:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1777:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1778:         _ecrire(d, (m + pad, m + pad), self.spec.get("titre", ""), self.px(g["titre_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1779:                 C.NAVY + (255,))
1780:         regle = Image.new("RGBA", carte.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
1781: 
1782:         def dessin(dd, k):
1783:             for i, (a, b) in enumerate(self.bornes):
1784:                 r = rh * k / 2 if i in (0, n - 1) else rh * k * 0.2
1785:                 dd.rounded_rectangle([a * k, (self.ry - rh / 2) * k, b * k, (self.ry + rh / 2) * k], radius=r,
1786:                                      fill=_ton(self.zones[i], self.rubrique) + (255,))
1787:         regle.alpha_composite(_net(carte.width, carte.height, dessin))
1788:         carte.alpha_composite(regle)
1789:         for i, (a, b) in enumerate(self.bornes):
1790:             _ecrire(d, ((a + b) / 2, self.ry + rh / 2 + self.px(g["label_ecart"])), self.zones[i]["label"], self.px(g["label_px"]),
1791:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, _ton(self.zones[i], self.rubrique) + (255,), "mt")
1792:         self.fond = _ombre(carte, self.s)
1793:         self.bulles = [_ombre_marge(_bulle(z["bulle"], self.px(g["bulle_px"]), self.px(g["bulle_h"]),
1794:                                            self.px(g["bulle_pad"]), _ton(z, self.rubrique)), self.s) for z in self.zones]
1795:         r = self.px(g["curseur"])
1796:         curseur = _net(2 * r + 4, 2 * r + 4, lambda dd, k: (
1797:             dd.ellipse([2 * k, 2 * k, (2 * r + 2) * k, (2 * r + 2) * k], fill=C.BLANC + (255,)),
1798:             dd.ellipse([2 * k + r * 0.28 * k, 2 * k + r * 0.28 * k, (2 * r + 2) * k - r * 0.28 * k,
1799:                         (2 * r + 2) * k - r * 0.28 * k], fill=C.NAVY + (255,))))
1800:         self.curseur = _ombre_marge(curseur, self.s)
1801:         self.ordre = self.spec.get("ordre", list(range(n)))
1802: 
1803:     def _etapes(self):
1804:         """[(zone, arrivee, depart)] : le curseur arrive au centre de chaque zone, s'y arrete."""
1805:         g = C.AGES_GEO
1806:         t = self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.8
1807:         out = []
1808:         for k, z in enumerate(self.ordre):
1809:             arrivee = t if k == 0 else t + g["deplacement"]
1810:             depart = arrivee + g["pause"]
1811:             out.append((z, arrivee, depart))
1812:             t = depart
1813:         return out
1814: 
1815:     def _x(self, z):
1816:         a, b = self.bornes[z]
1817:         return (a + b) / 2
1818: 
1819:     def image(self, t, final):
1820:         g = C.AGES_GEO
1821:         k, a = _entree(t, self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)), final)
1822:         if a <= 0:
1823:             return None
1824:         carte = self.fond.copy()
1825:         etapes = self._etapes()
1826:         if final:
1827:             z, x, bulle = etapes[-1][0], self._x(etapes[-1][0]), (etapes[-1][0], 1.0)
1828:         else:
1829:             x, bulle = self._x(etapes[0][0]), None
1830:             for i, (z, arr, dep) in enumerate(etapes):
1831:                 if t >= arr:
1832:                     x = self._x(z)
1833:                     bulle = (z, (t - arr) / C.INSERT_ENTREE)
1834:                 if i + 1 < len(etapes) and dep <= t < etapes[i + 1][1]:      # en chemin vers la suivante
1835:                     p = T.lisse((t - dep) / g["deplacement"])
1836:                     x = self._x(z) + (self._x(etapes[i + 1][0]) - self._x(z)) * p
1837:                     bulle = None
1838:             if t < etapes[0][1]:
1839:                 bulle = None
1840:         _poser(carte, self.curseur, x, self.ry)
1841:         if bulle:
1842:             z, u = bulle
1843:             kk = C.INSERT_ECHELLE + (1 - C.INSERT_ECHELLE) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u))
1844:             b = self.bulles[z]
1845:             bx = min(max(x, self.m + b.width / 2), self.m + self.w - b.width / 2)
1846:             _poser(carte, b, bx, self.ry - self.px(g["curseur"]) - self.px(g["bulle_ecart"]) - (b.height - 2 * self.m) / 2
1847:                    - self.m + self.m, kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u * C.INSERT_FONDU))
1848:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1849:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, a)
1850:         return out
1851: 
1852:     def sons(self):
1853:         e = self._etapes()
1854:         return [(e[0][1] - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.4, "souffle")] + [(arr, "clic") for _, arr, _ in e]
1855: 
1856: 
1857: # --------------------------------------------------------------- vases
1858: class Vases(_Insert):
1859:     """Deux bocaux communicants : vos revenus montent, votre pension baisse d'autant, des « +1 € »
1860:     et « −1 € » s'envolent ; au temps "ajout", une piece (« IJ ») tombe dans les revenus et la
1861:     pension baisse encore."""
1862: 
1863:     def taille_nominale(self):
1864:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.VASES_H
1865: 
1866:     def __init__(self, *a):
1867:         super().__init__(*a)
1868:         g, m = C.VASES_GEO, self.m
1869:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1870:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1871:         _ecrire(d, (m + self.w / 2, m + self.px(g["pad"])), self.spec.get("titre", ""), self.px(g["titre_px"]),
1872:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "mt")
1873:         self.vw, self.vh = self.px(g["vase"][0]), self.px(g["vase"][1])
1874:         self.fond_y = m + self.px(g["fond_y"])                              # bas des bocaux
1875:         self.cx = [m + self.w * c for c in g["col"]]
1876:         for cx, lab in zip(self.cx, (self.spec.get("gauche", ""), self.spec.get("droite", ""))):
1877:             _ecrire(d, (cx, self.fond_y + self.px(10)), lab, self.px(g["label_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1878:                     C.NAVY + (255,), "mt")
1879:         self.fond = carte
1880:         tr = self.px(g["trait"])
1881:         self.bocal = _net(self.vw, self.vh, lambda dd, k: dd.rounded_rectangle(
1882:             [tr * k / 2, tr * k / 2, (self.vw - tr / 2) * k, (self.vh - tr / 2) * k], radius=self.vw * k * 0.16,
1883:             outline=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=int(tr * k)))
1884:         self.masque = _net(self.vw, self.vh, lambda dd, k: dd.rounded_rectangle(
1885:             [tr * k, tr * k, (self.vw - tr) * k, (self.vh - tr) * k], radius=self.vw * k * 0.13,
1886:             fill=(255, 255, 255, 255))).getchannel("A")
1887:         j = self.px(g["jeton"])
1888:         jeton = _net(j, j, lambda dd, k: dd.ellipse([0, 0, j * k - 1, j * k - 1], fill=C.INSERT_VERT + (255,)))
1889:         _ecrire(ImageDraw.Draw(jeton), (j / 2, j / 2), self.spec.get("ajout", {}).get("label", ""),
1890:                 self.px(g["jeton_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
1891:         self.jeton = _ombre_marge(jeton, self.s)
1892: 
1893:     def _t(self):
1894:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)) + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.8
1895: 
1896:     def _t_ajout(self):
1897:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("ajout", {}).get("temps", 1)) + C.INSERT_DELAI
1898: 
1899:     def _niveaux(self, t, final):
1900:         g = C.VASES_GEO
1901:         p = 1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - self._t()) / g["remplissage"])
1902:         rev = g["revenus"][0] + (g["revenus"][1] - g["revenus"][0]) * p
1903:         pen = g["pension"][0] + (g["pension"][1] - g["pension"][0]) * p
1904:         if self.spec.get("ajout"):
1905:             q = 1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - self._t_ajout() - g["chute"]) / C.INSERT_ENTREE)
1906:             rev += g["ij"] * q
1907:             pen -= g["ij"] * q
1908:         return rev, pen
1909: 
1910:     def _contenu(self, niveau, couleur, t):
1911:         """Le bocal rempli jusqu'a niveau (0 a 1), surface ondulee."""
1912:         g = C.VASES_GEO
1913:         tr = self.px(g["trait"])
1914:         haut = tr + (self.vh - 2 * tr) * (1 - niveau)
1915:         amp = self.px(g["vague"])
1916: 
1917:         def dessin(dd, k):
1918:             pts = [(x * k, (haut + amp * math.sin(2 * math.pi * (x / self.vw * g["onde"][0] + t * g["onde"][1]))) * k)
1919:                    for x in range(0, self.vw + 1, max(1, self.vw // 24))]
1920:             dd.polygon(pts + [(self.vw * k, self.vh * k), (0, self.vh * k)], fill=tuple(couleur) + (255,))
1921:         im = _net(self.vw, self.vh, dessin)
1922:         im.putalpha(ImageChops.multiply(im.getchannel("A"), self.masque))
1923:         im.alpha_composite(self.bocal)
1924:         return im
1925: 
1926:     def image(self, t, final):
1927:         g = C.VASES_GEO
1928:         k, a = _entree(t, self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 0)), final)
1929:         if a <= 0:
1930:             return None
1931:         carte = self.fond.copy()
1932:         rev, pen = self._niveaux(t, final)
1933:         for cx, niveau, couleur in ((self.cx[0], rev, C.INSERT_VERT), (self.cx[1], pen, self.rubrique)):
1934:             v = self._contenu(niveau, couleur, 0 if final else t)
1935:             carte.alpha_composite(v, (int(round(cx - self.vw / 2)), int(round(self.fond_y - self.vh))))
1936:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1937:         if not final:                                    # les « +1 € » et « −1 € » s'envolent
1938:             n = int(g["remplissage"] / g["envol_pas"])
1939:             for i in range(n):
1940:                 ti = self._t() + i * g["envol_pas"]
1941:                 w2 = (t - ti) / g["envol"]
1942:                 if 0 < w2 < 1:
1943:                     al = int(255 * min(1.0, w2 * 4) * (1 - w2))
1944:                     dy = self.px(g["envol_dy"]) * T.lisse(w2)
1945:                     y = self.fond_y - self.vh * 0.35 - dy
1946:                     ecart = self.vw / 2 + self.px(g["envol_ecart"])
1947:                     _ecrire(d, (self.cx[0] - ecart, y), f"+1{NBSP}€", self.px(g["envol_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1948:                             C.INSERT_VERT + (al,), "rs")
1949:                     _ecrire(d, (self.cx[1] + ecart, y), f"−1{NBSP}€", self.px(g["envol_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1950:                             C.INSERT_ROUGE + (al,), "ls")
1951:         _ecrire(d, ((self.cx[0] + self.cx[1]) / 2, self.fond_y - self.vh * g["egal_y"]), "=", self.px(g["egal_px"]),
1952:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
1953:         if self.spec.get("ajout") and not final:         # le jeton tombe dans le bocal des revenus
1954:             w2 = (t - self._t_ajout()) / g["chute"]
1955:             if 0 < w2 < g["jeton_vie"]:
1956:                 y0 = self.fond_y - self.vh - self.px(g["jeton_haut"])
1957:                 y1 = self.fond_y - self.vh * (rev + 0.1)
1958:                 y = y0 + (y1 - y0) * min(1.0, w2) ** 2
1959:                 _poser(carte, self.jeton, self.cx[0], y, 1.0, min(1.0, (g["jeton_vie"] - w2) * 3))
1960:         carte = _ombre(carte, self.s)
1961:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
1962:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, a)
1963:         return out
1964: 
1965:     def sons(self):
1966:         out = [(self._t(), "compteur")]
1967:         if self.spec.get("ajout"):
1968:             out.append((self._t_ajout() + C.VASES_GEO["chute"], "clic"))
1969:         return out
1970: 
1971: 
1972: # -------------------------------------------------------------- pieces
1973: class Pieces(_Insert):
1974:     """Deux piles de pieces : a chaque cycle, deux pieces s'empilent a gauche (vos revenus au-dela du
1975:     seuil), une piece s'envole de la pile de droite (votre pension) ; les compteurs suivent."""
1976: 
1977:     def taille_nominale(self):
1978:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.PIECES_H
1979: 
1980:     def __init__(self, *a):
1981:         super().__init__(*a)
1982:         g, m = C.PIECES_GEO, self.m
1983:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
1984:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
1985:         _ecrire(d, (m + self.w / 2, m + self.px(g["pad"])), self.spec.get("titre", ""), self.px(g["titre_px"]),
1986:                 C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (255,), "mt")
1987:         self.sol = m + self.px(g["sol_y"])
1988:         self.cx = [m + self.w * c for c in g["col"]]
1989:         for cx, lab in zip(self.cx, (self.spec.get("gauche", ""), self.spec.get("droite", ""))):
1990:             _ecrire(d, (cx, self.sol + self.px(g["label_ecart"])), lab, self.px(g["label_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
1991:                     C.NAVY + (255,), "mt")
1992:         self.fond = carte
1993:         self.pas = self.px(g["epaisseur"])
1994:         self.pieces = {c: self._piece(c) for c in ("vert", "bleu", "rouge")}
1995: 
1996:     def _piece(self, ton):
1997:         g = C.PIECES_GEO
1998:         w, h, e = self.px(g["piece"][0]), self.px(g["piece"][1]), self.px(g["epaisseur"])
1999:         couleur = {"vert": C.INSERT_VERT, "rouge": C.INSERT_ROUGE}.get(ton, tuple(self.rubrique))
2000:         fonce = tuple(int(c * 0.72) for c in couleur)
2001: 
2002:         def dessin(dd, k):
2003:             dd.rounded_rectangle([0, h * k / 2, w * k - 1, (h / 2 + e) * k], radius=2 * k, fill=fonce + (255,))
2004:             dd.ellipse([0, e * k, w * k - 1, (h + e) * k - 1], fill=fonce + (255,))
2005:             dd.ellipse([0, 0, w * k - 1, h * k - 1], fill=couleur + (255,))
2006:             dd.ellipse([w * k * 0.2, h * k * 0.2, w * k * 0.8, h * k * 0.8], outline=_teinte(couleur, 0.4) + (255,),
2007:                        width=max(1, int(2 * k)))
2008:         return _net(w, h + e, dessin)
2009: 
2010:     def _cycles(self):
2011:         g = C.PIECES_GEO
2012:         t0 = self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 1)) + C.INSERT_DELAI
2013:         return [t0 + i * g["cycle"] for i in range(g["cycles"])]
2014: 
2015:     def image(self, t, final):
2016:         g = C.PIECES_GEO
2017:         k, a = _entree(t, self.t0(), final)
2018:         if a <= 0:
2019:             return None
2020:         carte = self.fond.copy()
2021:         cycles = self._cycles()
2022:         gagne = perdu = 0
2023:         chutes, envols = [], []
2024:         for tc in cycles:
2025:             for j in range(2):                            # deux pieces gagnees
2026:                 tj = tc + j * g["chute"] * g["chute_pas"]
2027:                 w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - tj) / g["chute"]
2028:                 if w2 >= 1:
2029:                     gagne += 1
2030:                 elif w2 > 0:
2031:                     chutes.append(w2)
2032:             tp = tc + g["chute"] * g["envol_delai"]                    # puis une piece de pension s'envole
2033:             w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - tp) / g["envol"]
2034:             if w2 >= 1:
2035:                 perdu += 1
2036:             elif w2 > 0:
2037:                 envols.append(w2)
2038:         ph = self.pieces["vert"].height
2039:         pile_d = self.spec.get("pension", g["pension"]) - perdu - len(envols)
2040:         for i in range(gagne):
2041:             carte.alpha_composite(self.pieces["vert"], (int(self.cx[0] - self.pieces["vert"].width / 2),
2042:                                                         int(self.sol - ph - i * self.pas)))
2043:         for w2 in chutes:                                 # une piece tombe sur la pile
2044:             y_fin = self.sol - ph - gagne * self.pas
2045:             y = y_fin - self.px(g["chute_haut"]) * (1 - w2 * w2)
2046:             T.coller(carte, self.pieces["vert"], (self.cx[0] - self.pieces["vert"].width / 2, y), min(1.0, w2 * 3))
2047:             gagne += 1
2048:         for i in range(pile_d):
2049:             carte.alpha_composite(self.pieces["bleu"], (int(self.cx[1] - self.pieces["bleu"].width / 2),
2050:                                                         int(self.sol - ph - i * self.pas)))
2051:         for w2 in envols:                                 # la piece du haut s'envole, rougit
2052:             y0 = self.sol - ph - pile_d * self.pas
2053:             x = self.cx[1] + self.px(g["envol_dx"]) * T.lisse(w2)
2054:             y = y0 - self.px(g["envol_dy"]) * T.lisse(w2)
2055:             T.coller(carte, self.pieces["rouge"], (x - self.pieces["rouge"].width / 2, y), 1 - w2)
2056:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
2057:         cp = self.px(g["compteur_px"])
2058:         y_c = self.sol - ph - (g["pension"] + 1) * self.pas - self.px(g["compteur_ecart"])
2059:         if gagne:
2060:             _ecrire(d, (self.cx[0], y_c), f"+{gagne}{NBSP}€", cp, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.INSERT_VERT + (255,), "ms")
2061:         if perdu:
2062:             _ecrire(d, (self.cx[1], y_c), f"−{perdu}{NBSP}€", cp, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255,), "ms")
2063:         carte = _ombre(carte, self.s)
2064:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
2065:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, a)
2066:         return out
2067: 
2068:     def sons(self):
2069:         g = C.PIECES_GEO
2070:         out = []
2071:         for tc in self._cycles():
2072:             out += [(tc + g["chute"], "clic"), (tc + g["chute"] * (1 + g["chute_pas"]), "clic"),
2073:                     (tc + g["chute"] * g["envol_delai"], "souffle")]
2074:         return out
2075: 
2076: 
2077: # ---------------------------------------------------------------- part
2078: class Part(_Insert):
2079:     """La part d'une activite : au temps 0, une pastille (« Cumul intégral, sans plafond ») ; au
2080:     temps "temps_part", l'anneau se remplit (le reste de l'activite), puis la part plafonnee se
2081:     detache en vert, son pourcentage au centre, la legende a droite."""
2082: 
2083:     def taille_nominale(self):
2084:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.PART_H
2085: 
2086:     def __init__(self, *a):
2087:         super().__init__(*a)
2088:         g, m = C.PART_GEO, self.m
2089:         carte = _cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=m)
2090:         self.fond = carte
2091:         self.r, self.ep = self.px(g["rayon"]), self.px(g["epaisseur"])
2092:         self.c = (m + self.px(g["pad"]) + self.r + self.ep / 2, m + self.h / 2)
2093:         self.part = self.spec["part"]
2094:         self.xl = self.c[0] + self.r + self.ep / 2 + self.px(g["colonne"])            # colonne de droite
2095:         self.pastille = _ombre_marge(_bulle(self.spec.get("pastille", ""), self.px(g["pilule_px"]),
2096:                                             self.px(g["pilule_h"]), self.px(g["pilule_pad"]), C.INSERT_VERT, queue=False), self.s)
2097: 
2098:     def _t_part(self):
2099:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps_part", 1)) + C.INSERT_DELAI
2100: 
2101:     def _anneau(self, p_reste, p_part, eclat):
2102:         g = C.PART_GEO
2103:         W, H = self.fond.size
2104:         cx, cy, r, e = self.c[0], self.c[1], self.r, self.ep
2105:         part = self.part / 100
2106: 
2107:         def dessin(dd, k):
2108:             box = [(cx - r) * k, (cy - r) * k, (cx + r) * k, (cy + r) * k]
2109:             dd.arc(box, 0, 360, fill=C.INSERT_GRIS + (255,), width=int(e * k))
2110:             if p_reste > 0:
2111:                 debut = -90 + 360 * part
2112:                 dd.arc(box, debut, debut + 360 * (1 - part) * p_reste, fill=tuple(self.rubrique) + (255,),
2113:                        width=int(e * k))
2114:             if p_part > 0:
2115:                 mil = math.radians(-90 + 180 * part)
2116:                 ox, oy = math.cos(mil) * eclat * k, math.sin(mil) * eclat * k
2117:                 b2 = [box[0] + ox, box[1] + oy, box[2] + ox, box[3] + oy]
2118:                 dd.arc(b2, -90, -90 + 360 * part * p_part, fill=C.INSERT_VERT + (255,), width=int(e * k))
2119:         return _net(W, H, dessin)
2120: 
2121:     def image(self, t, final):
2122:         g = C.PART_GEO
2123:         k, a = _entree(t, self.t0(), final)
2124:         if a <= 0:
2125:             return None
2126:         carte = self.fond.copy()
2127:         tp = self._t_part()
2128:         p_reste = 1.0 if final else T.lisse((t - tp) / g["remplissage"])
2129:         u = 1.0 if final else (t - tp - g["remplissage"]) / g["part_duree"]
2130:         p_part = 1.0 if final else T.lisse(u)
2131:         eclat = self.px(g["eclat"]) * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(u) if u > 0 else 0)
2132:         carte.alpha_composite(self._anneau(p_reste, p_part, eclat))
2133:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(carte)
2134:         cx, cy = self.c
2135:         if p_part > 0:
2136:             _ecrire(d, (cx, cy - self.px(g["centre_dy"])), f"{int(round(self.part * p_part))}{NBSP}%", self.px(g["centre_px"]),
2137:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.INSERT_VERT + (255,), "mm")
2138:             _ecrire(d, (cx, cy + self.px(g["centre_px"]) * 0.62), self.spec.get("centre", ""), self.px(g["petit_px"]),
2139:                     C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE, C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
2140:         v = 1.0 if final else (t - self.t0() - C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5) / C.INSERT_ENTREE
2141:         if v > 0:                                         # la pastille, en haut a droite
2142:             kk = 0.3 + 0.7 * (1.0 if final else T.rebond(v))
2143:             _poser(carte, self.pastille, self.xl + (self.pastille.width - 2 * self.m) / 2,
2144:                    self.m + self.px(g["pad"]) + self.px(g["pilule_h"]) / 2, kk, 1.0 if final else T.lisse(v * 2))
2145:         lp = self.px(g["legende_px"])
2146:         for i, (texte, couleur) in enumerate(((self.spec.get("legende_part", ""), C.INSERT_VERT),
2147:                                               (self.spec.get("legende_reste", ""), tuple(self.rubrique)))):
2148:             w2 = 1.0 if final else (t - tp - (g["remplissage"] + g["part_duree"] * 0.5 if i == 0 else 0.3)) / 0.4
2149:             if w2 <= 0:
2150:                 continue
2151:             al = int(255 * min(1.0, w2))
2152:             y = cy + self.px(g["legende_y"]) + i * lp * g["legende_pas"]
2153:             r = self.px(g["point"])
2154:             d.ellipse([self.xl, y - r, self.xl + 2 * r, y + r], fill=couleur + (al,))
2155:             _ecrire(d, (self.xl + 2 * r + self.px(g["point_ecart"]), y), texte, lp, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, C.NAVY + (al,), "lm")
2156:         carte = _ombre(carte, self.s)
2157:         out = Image.new("RGBA", (self.w + 2 * self.m, self.h + 2 * self.m), (0, 0, 0, 0))
2158:         _poser(out, carte, carte.width / 2, carte.height / 2, k, a)
2159:         return out
2160: 
2161:     def sons(self):
2162:         g = C.PART_GEO
2163:         return [(self.t0() + C.INSERT_ENTREE * 0.5, "clic"), (self._t_part(), "souffle"),
2164:                 (self._t_part() + g["remplissage"], "impact")]
2165: 
2166: 
2167: # ------------------------------------------------------------- bascule
2168: class Bascule(_Insert):
2169:     """Un ephemeride : la page « avant » se plie vers le haut, la page « apres » apparait dessous ;
2170:     a droite, la legende de chaque page, et une pilule rouge qui claque (« Nouvelles règles »)."""
2171: 
2172:     def taille_nominale(self):
2173:         g = C.BASCULE_GEO
2174:         return C.TEXTE_LARGEUR, C.BASCULE_H
2175: 
2176:     def _page(self, p):
2177:         g = C.BASCULE_GEO
2178:         w, h = self.px(g["page"][0]), self.px(g["page"][1])
2179:         tete, ra = self.px(g["tete"]), self.px(g["page_rayon"])
2180: 
2181:         def dessin(dd, k):
2182:             dd.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, w * k - 1, h * k - 1], radius=ra * k, fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
2183:             dd.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, w * k - 1, (tete + ra) * k], radius=ra * k,
2184:                                  fill=C.INSERT_ROUGE + (255,))
2185:             dd.rectangle([0, tete * k, w * k - 1, (tete + ra) * k], fill=C.BLANC + (255,))
2186:         im = _net(w, h, dessin)
2187:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(im)
2188:         _ecrire(d, (w / 2, tete / 2), T.normaliser(p["haut"]).upper(), self.px(g["mois_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
2189:                 C.BLANC + (255,), "mm")
2190:         _ecrire(d, (w / 2, tete + (h - tete) * 0.46), p["jour"], self.px(g["jour_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
2191:                 C.NAVY + (255,), "mm")
2192:         _ecrire(d, (w / 2, h - self.px(g["bas_y"])), p.get("bas", ""), self.px(g["bas_px"]), C.INSERT_GRAISSE_TEXTE,
2193:                 C.INSERT_GRIS_TEXTE + (255,), "mm")
2194:         return im
2195: 
2196:     def __init__(self, *a):
2197:         super().__init__(*a)
2198:         g = C.BASCULE_GEO
2199:         self.pages = [self._page(self.spec["avant"]), self._page(self.spec["apres"])]
2200:         aw, ah = self.px(g["anneau"][0]), self.px(g["anneau"][1])
2201:         self.anneau = _net(aw, ah, lambda dd, k: dd.rounded_rectangle([0, 0, aw * k - 1, ah * k - 1], radius=aw * k / 2,
2202:                                                                         fill=C.NAVY + (255,)))
2203:         self.px_x = self.m + self.px(g["page_marge"][0])                                    # gauche de la page
2204:         self.py = self.m + self.h - self.pages[0].height - self.px(g["page_marge"][1])       # haut de la page
2205:         self.carte = _ombre(_cadre(self.w, self.h, self.s, marge=self.m), self.s)
2206:         self.xl = self.px_x + self.pages[0].width + self.px(g["ecart"])
2207:         self.pilule = _ombre_marge(_bulle(self.spec.get("pilule", ""), self.px(g["pilule_px"]), self.px(g["pilule_h"]),
2208:                                           self.px(g["pilule_pad"]), C.INSERT_ROUGE, queue=False), self.s)
2209: 
2210:     def _t_pli(self):
2211:         return self.t0(self.spec.get("temps", 1)) + C.INSERT_DELAI
2212: 
2213:     def image(self, t, final):
2214:         g = C.BASCULE_GEO
2215:         k, a = _entree(t, self.t0(), final)
2216:         if a <= 0:
2217:             return None
2218:         cal = self.carte.copy()
2219:         p = 1.0 if final else max(0.0, min(1.0, (t - self._t_pli()) / g["pli"]))
2220:         pw, ph = self.pages[0].size
2221:         if p > 0:
2222:             cal.alpha_composite(_ombre_marge(self.pages[1], self.s), (int(self.px_x - self.m), int(self.py - self.m)))
2223:         if p < 1:                                         # la page « avant » se replie vers le haut
2224:             hh = max(1, int(ph * (1 - T.lisse(p))))
2225:             plie = self.pages[0].resize((pw, hh), Image.BICUBIC)
2226:             if p > 0:
2227:                 ombre = Image.new("RGBA", plie.size, (0, 0, 0, int(90 * p)))
2228:                 ombre.putalpha(ImageChops.multiply(ombre.getchannel("A"), plie.getchannel("A")))
2229:                 plie.alpha_composite(ombre)
2230:             cal.alpha_composite(_ombre_marge(plie, self.s), (int(self.px_x - self.m), int(self.py - self.m)))
2231:         aw = self.anneau.width
2232:         for fx in (0.28, 0.72):
2233:             cal.alpha_composite(self.anneau, (int(self.px_x + pw * fx - aw / 2), int(self.py - self.anneau.height * 0.6)))
2234:         d = ImageDraw.Draw(cal)
2235:         lp = self.px(g["legende_px"])
2236:         for i, cle in enumerate(("legende_avant", "legende_apres")):
2237:             texte = self.spec.get(cle, "")
2238:             q = 1 - min(1.0, p * 2) if i == 0 else max(0.0, p * 2 - 1)      # l'une s'efface, puis l'autre
2239:             if not texte or q <= 0:
2240:                 continue
2241:             al = int(255 * q)
2242:             lignes = _couper(texte, lp, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE, self.m + self.w - self.xl)
2243:             for j, l in enumerate(lignes):
2244:                 _ecrire(d, (self.xl, self.py + self.px(g["legende_y"]) + j * lp * 1.2), l, lp, C.INSERT_GRAISSE_FORTE,
2245:                         C.NAVY + (al,))
2246:         v = 1.0 if final else (t - self._t_pli() - g["pli"]) / C.TAMPON_FRAPPE
2247:         if v > 0:
2248:             kk = 1.0 if final or v >= 1 else C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - (C.TAMPON_ECHELLE - 1) * v * v
2249:             _poser(cal, self.pilule, self.xl + (self.pilule.width - 2 * self.m) / 2,
2250:                    self.py + self.pages[0].height - self.px(g["pilule_h"]) / 2 - self.px(g["pilule_dy"]), kk,
2251:                    1.0 if final else min(1.0, v * 2), -4)
2252:         out = Image.new("RGBA", cal.size, (0, 0, 0, 0))
2253:         _poser(out, cal, cal.width / 2, cal.height / 2, k, a)
2254:         return out
2255: 
2256:     def sons(self):
2257:         g = C.BASCULE_GEO
2258:         return [(self.t0(), "clic"), (self._t_pli(), "souffle"), (self._t_pli() + g["pli"] + C.TAMPON_FRAPPE, "impact")]
2259: 
